Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《星际迷航7：斗转星移》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:09.27,ENG,1,0,0,0,,How does it feel to be back on the Enterprise Bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.35,0:03:10.85,ENG,2,0,0,0,,Captain Kirk?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:13.44,ENG,3,0,0,0,,- Can I ask you a few questions?  - Did you participate in the redesign?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.82,ENG,4,0,0,0,,We'd like to know how you feel about being on...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:19.82,ENG,5,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Excuse me. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:22.41,ENG,6,0,0,0,,There will be plenty of time for questions later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:25.62,ENG,7,0,0,0,,I'm Captain John Harriman   and I'd like to welcome you all aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:27.83,ENG,8,0,0,0,,- It's our pleasure.  - I just want you to know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:29.54,ENG,9,0,0,0,,how excited we all are
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.79,0:03:33.71,ENG,10,0,0,0,,to have a group of living legends with us on our maiden voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:37.38,ENG,11,0,0,0,,I remember reading about your missions when I was in grade school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:38.59,ENG,12,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.01,0:03:45.60,ENG,13,0,0,0,,- Well   may we have a look around?  - Please   please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:47.97,ENG,14,0,0,0,,Yes   sir   it's very nice to finally meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.35,0:03:51.98,ENG,15,0,0,0,,- Demora!  - Excuse me. Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:54.48,ENG,16,0,0,0,,This is the first Starship Enterprise in 30 years
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:57.52,ENG,17,0,0,0,,without James T. Kirk in command. How do you feel about that   sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:03:59.82,ENG,18,0,0,0,,Just fine. I'm glad to be here to send her on her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.65,ENG,19,0,0,0,,And what have you been doing since you retired?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.20,ENG,20,0,0,0,,Keeping busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:06.03,ENG,21,0,0,0,,Captain Kirk   just a few more questions   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:09.49,ENG,22,0,0,0,,Why don't we give the Captain a chance to look around first?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:20.59,ENG,23,0,0,0,,Captain. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:26.72,ENG,24,0,0,0,,I'd like you to meet the helmsman of the Enterprise-B. Demora.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.39,0:04:29.56,ENG,25,0,0,0,,Ensign Demora Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:34.52,ENG,26,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:38.02,ENG,27,0,0,0,,My father's told me some interesting stories about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:41.15,ENG,28,0,0,0,,- Your father is Hikaru Sulu?  - Yes   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:44.32,ENG,29,0,0,0,,- You've met her before   but she was...  - It wasn't that long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:47.07,ENG,30,0,0,0,,- It couldn't have been more than...  - Twelve years   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:49.28,ENG,31,0,0,0,,- Twelve years?  - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:51.87,ENG,32,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.16,0:04:53.70,ENG,33,0,0,0,,Congratulations   Ensign.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:56.96,ENG,34,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be the Enterprise without a Sulu at the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:58.04,ENG,35,0,0,0,,Thank you   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.17,0:05:00.46,ENG,36,0,0,0,,I'm sure Hikaru must be very proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:02.05,ENG,37,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:07.22,ENG,38,0,0,0,,I was never that young.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:11.56,ENG,39,0,0,0,,No   you were younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:19.86,ENG,40,0,0,0,,- Damn fine ship if you ask me.  - Scotty   it absolutely amazes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:22.23,ENG,41,0,0,0,,And what would that be   sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.19,0:05:26.53,ENG,42,0,0,0,,Sulu   when did he find time for a family?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.82,0:05:27.82,ENG,43,0,0,0,,Well   like you always say
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:30.20,ENG,44,0,0,0,,if something's important   you make the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:34.08,ENG,45,0,0,0,,So that's why you seem so restless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:36.50,ENG,46,0,0,0,,Finding retirement a little lonely   are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:39.17,ENG,47,0,0,0,,You know   I'm glad you're an engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:42.50,ENG,48,0,0,0,,With tact like that   you'd make a lousy psychiatrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:47.84,ENG,49,0,0,0,,Excuse me   gentlemen   if you'll take your seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:51.35,ENG,50,0,0,0,,Yes   of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.01,ENG,51,0,0,0,,Prepare to leave spacedock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:57.02,ENG,52,0,0,0,,Aft thrusters ahead one-quarter   port and starboard at station keeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:58.85,ENG,53,0,0,0,,- Captain Kirk.  - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:06:01.69,ENG,54,0,0,0,,I'd be honored if you'd give the order to get underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:06.36,ENG,55,0,0,0,,- Thank you very much   I...  - Please   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:09.28,ENG,56,0,0,0,,- No   no   no   no.  - Please   I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:20.25,ENG,57,0,0,0,,Take us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:31.22,ENG,58,0,0,0,,- Very good   sir.  - Brought a tear to me eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:32.64,ENG,59,0,0,0,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:53.57,ENG,60,0,0,0,,Gentlemen   gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:55.87,ENG,61,0,0,0,,Now that you've seen the rest of the ship
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.99,0:06:57.75,ENG,62,0,0,0,,how does it feel to be back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:00.16,ENG,63,0,0,0,,- Well   we... Fine.  - Fine   fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.29,0:07:02.50,ENG,64,0,0,0,,- Fine   fine.  - Well   ladies and gentlemen
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:04.67,ENG,65,0,0,0,,we've just cleared the asteroid belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:07.25,ENG,66,0,0,0,,Our course today will take us out beyond Pluto
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:10.59,ENG,67,0,0,0,,and then back to spacedock. Just a quick run around the block.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:13.64,ENG,68,0,0,0,,Captain   will there be time to conduct any tests on the warp drive system?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:17.89,ENG,69,0,0,0,,We're picking up a distress call   Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:23.48,ENG,70,0,0,0,,On speakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:26.61,ENG,71,0,0,0,,This is the transport ship Lakul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:29.44,ENG,72,0,0,0,,We're caught in some kind of energy distortion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:34.12,ENG,73,0,0,0,,Two ships in our convoy...trapped in a severe gravimetric distortion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:37.08,ENG,74,0,0,0,,We can't break free. We need immediate help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:40.87,ENG,75,0,0,0,,It's tearing us apart. This is the transport...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:43.08,ENG,76,0,0,0,,The Lakul is one of two ships
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:44.92,ENG,77,0,0,0,,transporting El-Aurian refugees to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.55,ENG,78,0,0,0,,Ensign Sulu   can you locate them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:51.55,ENG,79,0,0,0,,The ships are bearing at 3-1-0 mark 2-1-5.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:07:54.01,ENG,80,0,0,0,,Distance   three light-years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:00.56,ENG,81,0,0,0,,Signal the closest starship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:03.39,ENG,82,0,0,0,,We're in no condition to mount a rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:10.61,ENG,83,0,0,0,,- We don't even have a full crew aboard.  - We're the only one in range   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:21.87,ENG,84,0,0,0,,Well   then   I guess it's up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:27.04,ENG,85,0,0,0,,Helm   lay in an intercept course and engage at maximum warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.21,0:08:28.71,ENG,86,0,0,0,,Aye   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:39.31,ENG,87,0,0,0,,Captain   is there something wrong with your chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:50.36,ENG,88,0,0,0,,We're within visual range of the energy distortion   Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:53.78,ENG,89,0,0,0,,On screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:08:59.95,ENG,90,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:04.00,ENG,91,0,0,0,,I've located the transport ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:08.79,ENG,92,0,0,0,,Their hulls are starting to buckle under the stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:11.46,ENG,93,0,0,0,,They won't survive much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:17.80,ENG,94,0,0,0,,We're encountering severe gravimetric distortions
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.89,0:09:20.14,ENG,95,0,0,0,,from the energy ribbon   Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:24.89,ENG,96,0,0,0,,We'll have to keep our distance. We don't wanna get pulled in   too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:28.31,ENG,97,0,0,0,,- Tractor beam. Tractor beam.  - We don't have a tractor beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.65,0:09:30.61,ENG,98,0,0,0,,You left spacedock without a tractor beam?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:33.15,ENG,99,0,0,0,,It won't be installed until Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:35.90,ENG,100,0,0,0,,Ensign Sulu
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:41.66,ENG,101,0,0,0,,try generating a subspace field around the ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:43.45,ENG,102,0,0,0,,That might break them free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.66,ENG,103,0,0,0,,There's too much quantum interference   Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:50.08,ENG,104,0,0,0,,What about... What about venting plasma from the warp nacelles?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:52.00,ENG,105,0,0,0,,That might disrupt the ribbon's hold on the ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:55.05,ENG,106,0,0,0,,Aye   sir. Releasing drive plasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.18,ENG,107,0,0,0,,It's not having any effect   sir. I think the ribbon's hold...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:10:01.85,ENG,108,0,0,0,,Sir   the starboard vessel's hull is collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:12.44,ENG,109,0,0,0,,- How many people were on that ship?  - Two hundred and sixty-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:22.74,ENG,110,0,0,0,,Sir   the Lakul's hull integrity is down to 12%.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:35.38,ENG,111,0,0,0,,Captain Kirk   I would appreciate any suggestions you might have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:38.92,ENG,112,0,0,0,,First   move us within transporter range.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:40.51,ENG,113,0,0,0,,Beam those people aboard the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:43.43,ENG,114,0,0,0,,What about the gravimetric distortions? They'll tear us apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:46.56,ENG,115,0,0,0,,Risk is part of the game if you wanna sit in that chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.77,0:10:48.56,ENG,116,0,0,0,,Helm   close to within transporter range.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:50.73,ENG,117,0,0,0,,Second   turn that damn thing off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:10:59.99,ENG,118,0,0,0,,- We're within range   sir.  - Beam them directly to Sickbay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:03.07,ENG,119,0,0,0,,- Aye   sir.  - How big is your medical staff?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:06.74,ENG,120,0,0,0,,The medical staff? It doesn't arrive till Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:10.50,ENG,121,0,0,0,,You and you   you've just become nurses. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.58,0:11:14.34,ENG,122,0,0,0,,Main Engineering reports fluctuations in the warp plasma relays.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.42,0:11:17.05,ENG,123,0,0,0,,Sir   I'm having trouble locking on to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:20.26,ENG,124,0,0,0,,They appear to be in some sort of temporal flux.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.34,0:11:21.43,ENG,125,0,0,0,,Scotty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:25.68,ENG,126,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:29.89,ENG,127,0,0,0,,Their life signs are phasing in and out of our space-time continuum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:31.60,ENG,128,0,0,0,,Phasing? To where?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:35.61,ENG,129,0,0,0,,- Sir   their hull's collapsing!  - Beam them out of there   Scotty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:44.28,ENG,130,0,0,0,,Transport complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:52.29,ENG,131,0,0,0,,I got 47
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:55.96,ENG,132,0,0,0,,out of 150.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.89,0:12:12.10,ENG,133,0,0,0,,- Report!  - We're caught in a gravimetric field
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:14.27,ENG,134,0,0,0,,emanating from the trailing edge of the ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.35,0:12:16.73,ENG,135,0,0,0,,All engines   full reverse!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:25.24,ENG,136,0,0,0,,It's going to be all right. We're going to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.41,0:12:26.74,ENG,137,0,0,0,,We are going to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:29.54,ENG,138,0,0,0,,- It's okay. Everything is fine.  - My wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:31.50,ENG,139,0,0,0,,Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:34.92,ENG,140,0,0,0,,It's all right. You're safe. You're on the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:38.92,ENG,141,0,0,0,,- No   no   I have to go. I have to go back.  - You need to stay right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:41.05,ENG,142,0,0,0,,- No. You don't understand.  - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:43.76,ENG,143,0,0,0,,Let me go back. Let me go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:48.26,ENG,144,0,0,0,,Let me go back. Let me go back. Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:53.93,ENG,145,0,0,0,,- What was he talking about?  - I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:55.85,ENG,146,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.28,ENG,147,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:09.74,ENG,148,0,0,0,,It's going to be okay. You'll be all right. You just need to rest. Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:19.00,ENG,149,0,0,0,,There's just no way to disrupt a gravimetric field of this magnitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:22.30,ENG,150,0,0,0,,- Hull integrity at 82%.  - But I do have a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:23.88,ENG,151,0,0,0,,I thought you might.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:26.88,ENG,152,0,0,0,,An antimatter discharge directly ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:30.55,ENG,153,0,0,0,,might disrupt the field long enough for us to break away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:32.22,ENG,154,0,0,0,,- Photon torpedoes.  - Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:33.39,ENG,155,0,0,0,,We're losing main power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:35.64,ENG,156,0,0,0,,Load torpedo bays. Prepare to fire at my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:40.56,ENG,157,0,0,0,,- Captain   we don't have any torpedoes.  - Don't tell me   Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:45.15,ENG,158,0,0,0,,- Hull integrity at 40%.  - Captain   it may be possible
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:46.95,ENG,159,0,0,0,,to simulate a torpedo blast
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.07,0:13:50.32,ENG,160,0,0,0,,using a resonance burst from the main deflector dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:54.62,ENG,161,0,0,0,,- Where are the deflector relays?  - Deck 15   Section 21-Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:57.16,ENG,162,0,0,0,,I'll go. You have the Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:03.42,ENG,163,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.59,0:14:07.84,ENG,164,0,0,0,,Your place is on the bridge of your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:11.18,ENG,165,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:17.81,ENG,166,0,0,0,,Scotty   keep things together until I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.94,0:14:19.60,ENG,167,0,0,0,,I always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:28.88,ENG,168,0,0,0,,Forty-five seconds to structural collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:31.38,ENG,169,0,0,0,,Bridge to Captain Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.84,0:15:33.93,ENG,170,0,0,0,,Kirk here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:37.26,ENG,171,0,0,0,,I don't know how much longer I can hold her together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.73,0:15:48.69,ENG,172,0,0,0,,That's it. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:50.94,ENG,173,0,0,0,,Activate main deflector.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.79,0:15:59.95,ENG,174,0,0,0,,We're breaking free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:21.73,ENG,175,0,0,0,,It's all right. I'm increasing power to compensate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:25.94,ENG,176,0,0,0,,- We're clear.  - You did it   Kirk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:27.81,ENG,177,0,0,0,,Damage report   Ensign.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:30.44,ENG,178,0,0,0,,There's some buckling on the starboard nacelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:32.99,ENG,179,0,0,0,,We've also got a hull breach in Engineering section.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:35.45,ENG,180,0,0,0,,Emergency force fields in place and holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:36.99,ENG,181,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:42.25,ENG,182,0,0,0,,Sections 20 through 28 on Decks 13 14
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:46.25,ENG,183,0,0,0,,and 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:53.26,ENG,184,0,0,0,,Bridge to Captain Kirk. Captain Kirk   please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:17:00.93,ENG,185,0,0,0,,Have Chekov meet me on Deck 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:31.71,ENG,186,0,0,0,,My God! Was anyone in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:36.22,ENG,187,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.95,0:18:47.79,ENG,188,0,0,0,,Bring out the prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:03.14,ENG,189,0,0,0,,Mr. Worf   I always knew this day would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:07.43,ENG,190,0,0,0,,- Are you prepared to face the charges?  - Answer him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.31,0:19:11.60,ENG,191,0,0,0,,I am prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.65,0:19:18.57,ENG,192,0,0,0,,"We   the officers and crew of the U.S.S. Enterprise
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.65,0:19:20.74,ENG,193,0,0,0,,"being of sound mind and judgment
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:24.41,ENG,194,0,0,0,,"hereby make the following charges against Lieutenant Worf.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.58,0:19:28.75,ENG,195,0,0,0,,"One   that he did knowingly and willfully
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:33.50,ENG,196,0,0,0,,"perform above and beyond the call of duty on countless occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:35.50,ENG,197,0,0,0,,"Two   most seriously
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:40.51,ENG,198,0,0,0,,"that he has earned the admiration and respect of the entire crew."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:45.18,ENG,199,0,0,0,,Mr. Worf   I hereby promote you to the rank of Lieutenant Commander
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.81,0:19:48.68,ENG,200,0,0,0,,with all the rights and privileges thereto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:51.69,ENG,201,0,0,0,,And may God have mercy on your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.69,0:19:58.94,ENG,202,0,0,0,,- Hip   hip...  - Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.03,0:20:00.24,ENG,203,0,0,0,,- Hip   hip...  - Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.32,0:20:01.61,ENG,204,0,0,0,,- Hip   hip...  - Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.03,0:20:04.49,ENG,205,0,0,0,,- Congratulations   Mr. Worf.  - Thank you   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:06.66,ENG,206,0,0,0,,Extend the plank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.13,0:20:16.21,ENG,207,0,0,0,,Lower the badge of office.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:20.84,ENG,208,0,0,0,,- Be careful.  - You go get that hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:23.80,ENG,209,0,0,0,,He'll never make it. No one ever has.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.81,0:20:31.18,ENG,210,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:49.24,ENG,211,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes   Worf!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:51.66,ENG,212,0,0,0,,If there's one thing I've learned over the years
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:54.00,ENG,213,0,0,0,,it's never to underestimate a Klingon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:00.71,ENG,214,0,0,0,,Computer   remove the plank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:04.59,ENG,215,0,0,0,,Oh   no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:16.52,ENG,216,0,0,0,,Number One   that's "retract" plank   not "remove" plank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:18.10,ENG,217,0,0,0,,Of course   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:21.94,ENG,218,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.37,0:21:32.87,ENG,219,0,0,0,,Doctor   I must confess   I am uncertain as to why
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:36.41,ENG,220,0,0,0,,someone falling into freezing water is amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:38.46,ENG,221,0,0,0,,It's all in good fun   Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:40.21,ENG,222,0,0,0,,- Fun?  - Fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.30,0:21:43.30,ENG,223,0,0,0,,I do not understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:46.13,ENG,224,0,0,0,,You've got to get into the spirit of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:49.30,ENG,225,0,0,0,,Learn to be spontaneous   live in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:52.64,ENG,226,0,0,0,,- Do something unexpected. Get it?  - Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:19.12,ENG,227,0,0,0,,- Data.  - That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.25,0:22:20.75,ENG,228,0,0,0,,Not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.25,0:22:26.92,ENG,229,0,0,0,,All hands   make sail. T'gansuls and courses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.43,0:22:29.59,ENG,230,0,0,0,,- Stand by the braces.  - Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.27,0:22:39.48,ENG,231,0,0,0,,Just imagine what it was like. No engines   no computers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.60,0:22:44.44,ENG,232,0,0,0,,just the wind and the sea and the stars to guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.53,0:22:47.61,ENG,233,0,0,0,,Bad food   brutal discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:49.90,ENG,234,0,0,0,,No women.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.99,0:22:52.53,ENG,235,0,0,0,,- Bridge to Captain Picard.  - Picard here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.03,0:22:56.12,ENG,236,0,0,0,,There's a personal message for you from Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.45,0:22:58.29,ENG,237,0,0,0,,Put it through down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.37,0:23:01.83,ENG,238,0,0,0,,The best thing about life at sea   Will   was that no one could reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:05.38,ENG,239,0,0,0,,This was freedom   Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:08.97,ENG,240,0,0,0,,Computer   arch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.35,0:23:15.06,ENG,241,0,0,0,,Look alive there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.90,0:23:30.82,ENG,242,0,0,0,,Here   take the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.88,0:23:55.76,ENG,243,0,0,0,,Captain   are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.26,0:24:01.39,ENG,244,0,0,0,,Yes   I'm fine. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:05.44,ENG,245,0,0,0,,Computer   exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.28,0:24:16.78,ENG,246,0,0,0,,- Mr. La Forge   set royals and studsail.  - What's a studsail   sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.54,0:24:19.83,ENG,247,0,0,0,,You see that last yardarm? Just above that...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.91,0:24:22.62,ENG,248,0,0,0,,- Bridge to Holodeck 3.  - Riker here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.71,0:24:25.75,ENG,249,0,0,0,,We're picking up a distress call from the Amargosa Observatory   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.88,0:24:28.04,ENG,250,0,0,0,,They say they're under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.55,0:24:32.26,ENG,251,0,0,0,,Red alert! All hands to battle stations. Captain Picard to the Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.44,0:24:49.40,ENG,252,0,0,0,,- It looks like we're too late.  - There are no other ships in the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.82,0:24:52.57,ENG,253,0,0,0,,Captain   we're approaching Amargosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.90,0:24:55.45,ENG,254,0,0,0,,Looks like the observatory took quite a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.57,0:24:56.74,ENG,255,0,0,0,,Survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.82,0:24:59.45,ENG,256,0,0,0,,Sensors show five life signs aboard the station   Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.58,0:25:01.83,ENG,257,0,0,0,,The station's complement was 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.67,0:25:06.67,ENG,258,0,0,0,,Stand down from red alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.25,0:25:11.17,ENG,259,0,0,0,,Number One
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.93,0:25:17.68,ENG,260,0,0,0,,will you begin an investigation? I'll be in my Ready Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.76,0:25:20.60,ENG,261,0,0,0,,- Sir? I thought you wanted...  - Make it so. Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.47,0:25:24.60,ENG,262,0,0,0,,- Mr. Worf.  - Aye   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.16,0:25:43.12,ENG,263,0,0,0,,Mr. Worf   you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.54,0:25:46.71,ENG,264,0,0,0,,These blast patterns are consistent with a type-3 disruptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.79,0:25:51.21,ENG,265,0,0,0,,Great. That narrows it down to Romulan   Breen and Klingon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.55,0:26:36.17,ENG,266,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.51,0:26:41.89,ENG,267,0,0,0,,It's all right. Do not struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.10,0:26:53.73,ENG,268,0,0,0,,It's okay. We're right here. Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.78,0:27:05.03,ENG,269,0,0,0,,I'm Commander William Riker from the Starship Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.79,0:27:10.54,ENG,270,0,0,0,,Soran. Dr. Tolian Soran.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.46,0:27:17.30,ENG,271,0,0,0,,- Who attacked you   Doctor?  - I don't know. It all happened so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.76,0:27:20.97,ENG,272,0,0,0,,Commander   you better take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.74,0:27:43.07,ENG,273,0,0,0,,Romulans.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.28,0:27:49.75,ENG,274,0,0,0,,Data   whatever possessed you to push her in the water in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:53.79,ENG,275,0,0,0,,I was attempting to get into the spirit of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.63,0:27:57.50,ENG,276,0,0,0,,I thought it would be amusing. Spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.01,0:28:00.51,ENG,277,0,0,0,,Is she still angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.59,0:28:04.34,ENG,278,0,0,0,,I'd stay out of Sickbay for a couple of days if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.48,0:28:20.57,ENG,279,0,0,0,,Data   you're not actually thinking about using that thing   are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.65,0:28:23.28,ENG,280,0,0,0,,I have considered it for many months.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.61,0:28:26.87,ENG,281,0,0,0,,And in light of my recent episode with Dr. Crusher
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.28,0:28:29.58,ENG,282,0,0,0,,now may be the appropriate time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.66,0:28:32.83,ENG,283,0,0,0,,I thought you were worried about it overloading your neural net.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.50,0:28:35.21,ENG,284,0,0,0,,That is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.50,0:28:40.17,ENG,285,0,0,0,,However   I believe my growth as an artificial life-form
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.30,0:28:42.30,ENG,286,0,0,0,,has reached an impasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.38,0:28:46.84,ENG,287,0,0,0,,For 34 years   I have endeavored to become more human
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.47,0:28:50.18,ENG,288,0,0,0,,to grow beyond my original programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.48,0:28:56.19,ENG,289,0,0,0,,Still   I am unable to grasp such a basic concept as humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.15,0:29:01.86,ENG,290,0,0,0,,This emotion chip may be the only answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.04,0:29:17.21,ENG,291,0,0,0,,Geordi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.38,0:29:21.71,ENG,292,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.19,0:29:41.23,ENG,293,0,0,0,,Listen   at the first sign of trouble   I'm gonna deactivate it. Agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.69,0:29:44.19,ENG,294,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.70,0:29:52.12,ENG,295,0,0,0,,We found two dead Romulans on the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.74,0:29:54.58,ENG,296,0,0,0,,We're analyzing their equipment to see if we can determine
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.71,0:29:56.29,ENG,297,0,0,0,,what ship they came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.54,0:30:00.71,ENG,298,0,0,0,,And there's still no indication of why they attacked the station?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.09,0:30:05.38,ENG,299,0,0,0,,They practically tore the place apart. Accessed the central computer
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.72,0:30:07.09,ENG,300,0,0,0,,turned the cargo bay inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.22,0:30:09.80,ENG,301,0,0,0,,Obviously   they were looking for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.10,0:30:13.89,ENG,302,0,0,0,,This could signify a new Romulan threat in this sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.23,0:30:21.73,ENG,303,0,0,0,,- Inform Starfleet Command.  - You want me to contact Starfleet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.23,0:30:23.90,ENG,304,0,0,0,,- Is there a problem?  - No   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:28.74,ENG,305,0,0,0,,There was something else   Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.95,0:30:32.74,ENG,306,0,0,0,,One of the scientists   a Dr. Soran   insisted on speaking with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.24,0:30:34.58,ENG,307,0,0,0,,I told him you were very busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.66,0:30:38.08,ENG,308,0,0,0,,He said it was absolutely imperative that he speak with you right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.17,0:30:40.12,ENG,309,0,0,0,,Understood. That will be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.47,0:30:52.09,ENG,310,0,0,0,,- Sir   is there anything more...  - No   thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.82,0:31:13.78,ENG,311,0,0,0,,Gentlemen   something new from Forcas III?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.33,0:31:22.46,ENG,312,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.54,0:31:26.46,ENG,313,0,0,0,,I believe this beverage has produced an emotional response.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.63,0:31:28.55,ENG,314,0,0,0,,Really? What are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.13,0:31:32.68,ENG,315,0,0,0,,I am uncertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.05,0:31:34.80,ENG,316,0,0,0,,Because I have had little experience with emotion
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.89,0:31:37.97,ENG,317,0,0,0,,I am unable to articulate the sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.31,0:31:43.06,ENG,318,0,0,0,,- Emotion?  - I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.19,0:31:51.65,ENG,319,0,0,0,,- Well   it looks like he hates it.  - Yes   that is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.03,0:31:56.83,ENG,320,0,0,0,,- I hate this.  - Data   I think the chip is working.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.21,0:32:04.96,ENG,321,0,0,0,,Yes   I hate this. It is revolting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.04,0:32:07.00,ENG,322,0,0,0,,- More?  - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.18,0:32:18.89,ENG,323,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a Dr. Soran from the observatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.28,0:32:29.78,ENG,324,0,0,0,,- Dr. Soran?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.19,0:32:32.36,ENG,325,0,0,0,,Yes   Captain   thank you for coming. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.45,0:32:35.16,ENG,326,0,0,0,,I understand there's something urgent you wish to discuss with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.24,0:32:38.62,ENG,327,0,0,0,,Yes. I must return to the observatory immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.79,0:32:42.75,ENG,328,0,0,0,,I must continue a critical experiment I've been running on the Amargosa star.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.87,0:32:45.21,ENG,329,0,0,0,,We're still conducting our investigation into the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.29,0:32:46.92,ENG,330,0,0,0,,- Yes   I...  - As soon as that is complete
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.04,0:32:48.67,ENG,331,0,0,0,,then I will allow you and your colleagues to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.75,0:32:50.42,ENG,332,0,0,0,,But until then   there's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.55,0:32:54.30,ENG,333,0,0,0,,Timing is very important in my experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.14,0:33:00.14,ENG,334,0,0,0,,If it's not completed in the next 12 hours   years of research will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.22,0:33:03.43,ENG,335,0,0,0,,We're doing the best we can. If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.56,0:33:10.15,ENG,336,0,0,0,,They say time is the fire in which we burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.65,0:33:17.24,ENG,337,0,0,0,,Right now   Captain   my time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.62,0:33:23.41,ENG,338,0,0,0,,We leave so many things unfinished in our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.17,0:33:27.25,ENG,339,0,0,0,,I know you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.59,0:33:32.59,ENG,340,0,0,0,,I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.38,0:34:18.18,ENG,341,0,0,0,,We have analyzed the Romulans' tricorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.30,0:34:20.18,ENG,342,0,0,0,,They were scanning for signature particles
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.30,0:34:23.56,ENG,343,0,0,0,,- of a compound called trilithium.  - Trilithium?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.64,0:34:26.73,ENG,344,0,0,0,,Yes   an experimental compound the Romulans have been working on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.81,0:34:29.02,ENG,345,0,0,0,,Trilithium is a nuclear inhibitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.31,0:34:32.40,ENG,346,0,0,0,,In theory   it could stop all fusion within a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.48,0:34:35.69,ENG,347,0,0,0,,However   the Romulans never found a way to stabilize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.82,0:34:37.57,ENG,348,0,0,0,,Why would they look for it on a Federation observatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.65,0:34:39.20,ENG,349,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.99,0:34:41.57,ENG,350,0,0,0,,I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.66,0:34:43.91,ENG,351,0,0,0,,Have Geordi and Data go over with the next away team.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.99,0:34:45.62,ENG,352,0,0,0,,Tell them to scan the observatory for trilithium.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.70,0:34:47.25,ENG,353,0,0,0,,Aye   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.54,0:34:56.17,ENG,354,0,0,0,,Well   there's no sign of any trilithium over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.72,0:35:08.43,ENG,355,0,0,0,,- I get it! I get it!  - You get what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.19,0:35:13.81,ENG,356,0,0,0,,When you said to Commander Riker   "The clown can stay
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.90,0:35:17.07,ENG,357,0,0,0,,"but the Ferengi in the gorilla suit has to go."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.20,0:35:19.61,ENG,358,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.70,0:35:21.74,ENG,359,0,0,0,,During the Farpoint mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.87,0:35:26.29,ENG,360,0,0,0,,We were on the Bridge. You told a joke. That was the punch line.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.29,0:35:30.37,ENG,361,0,0,0,,Farpoint... Data   that was seven years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.46,0:35:33.04,ENG,362,0,0,0,,I know. I just got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.54,0:35:35.92,ENG,363,0,0,0,,Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.15,0:35:59.32,ENG,364,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. There's a door hidden right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.82,0:36:01.90,ENG,365,0,0,0,,I can see the separation with my visor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.16,0:36:04.66,ENG,366,0,0,0,,There appears to be a dampening field in operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.74,0:36:07.33,ENG,367,0,0,0,,I cannot scan beyond the bulkhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.83,0:36:11.79,ENG,368,0,0,0,,There doesn't seem to be a control panel or an access port.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.12,0:36:15.08,ENG,369,0,0,0,,It appears to be magnetically sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.09,0:36:20.51,ENG,370,0,0,0,,I believe I can reverse the polarity by attenuating my axial servo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.01,0:36:29.27,ENG,371,0,0,0,,Open sesame.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.81,0:36:39.82,ENG,372,0,0,0,,You could say I have a magnetic personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.99,0:36:44.32,ENG,373,0,0,0,,Humor   I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.55,0:37:07.85,ENG,374,0,0,0,,Data   come take a look at this   will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.39,0:37:14.98,ENG,375,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen a solar probe with this kind of configuration?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.15,0:37:19.02,ENG,376,0,0,0,,No   Geordi   I have not. Have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.40,0:37:22.40,ENG,377,0,0,0,,No   I have not. It is most unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.90,0:37:25.91,ENG,378,0,0,0,,Mr. Tricorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.53,0:37:30.49,ENG,379,0,0,0,,Just see if you can help me get these panels open   will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.83,0:37:32.41,ENG,380,0,0,0,,Make it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.25,0:37:43.05,ENG,381,0,0,0,,My visor's picking up something in the theta band.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.17,0:37:45.42,ENG,382,0,0,0,,It could be a trilithium signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.93,0:37:51.51,ENG,383,0,0,0,,- Data   we don't have time for this.  - I cannot help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.93,0:37:54.68,ENG,384,0,0,0,,I think something is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.52,0:38:02.94,ENG,385,0,0,0,,Data?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.95,0:38:14.24,ENG,386,0,0,0,,Data. Data   are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.08,0:38:23.38,ENG,387,0,0,0,,I believe the emotion chip has overloaded my positronic relay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.46,0:38:26.72,ENG,388,0,0,0,,We'd better get you back to the ship. La Forge to Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.55,0:38:34.14,ENG,389,0,0,0,,- La Forge to Enterprise.  - Gentlemen   is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.89,0:38:36.39,ENG,390,0,0,0,,Dr. Soran.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.64,0:38:39.98,ENG,391,0,0,0,,Yeah. There seems to be some sort of dampening field in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.06,0:38:42.98,ENG,392,0,0,0,,It's blocking our comm signal. Can you shut it off for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.15,0:38:46.28,ENG,393,0,0,0,,Of course   I'd be only too happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.29,0:39:00.00,ENG,394,0,0,0,,Please. Please. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.25,0:39:05.75,ENG,395,0,0,0,,Do not... Do not hurt me. Please   please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.19,0:39:28.86,ENG,396,0,0,0,,Yes   come.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.86,0:39:33.95,ENG,397,0,0,0,,Yes   Counselor? Is there something I can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.95,0:39:34.95,ENG,398,0,0,0,,Actually I'm here to see if there's anything I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.46,0:39:40.37,ENG,399,0,0,0,,It's just family matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.46,0:39:46.63,ENG,400,0,0,0,,You never met my brother and his wife   did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.46,0:39:49.72,ENG,401,0,0,0,,- No.  - Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.39,0:39:57.47,ENG,402,0,0,0,,So opinionated. So pompous and arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.39,0:40:00.39,ENG,403,0,0,0,,He always had to have the last word.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.48,0:40:05.31,ENG,404,0,0,0,,But he mellowed a little bit in the last few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.07,0:40:11.24,ENG,405,0,0,0,,I was going to get together with them all next month on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.32,0:40:13.66,ENG,406,0,0,0,,I thought we'd go to San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.74,0:40:16.53,ENG,407,0,0,0,,René's always wanted to see Starfleet Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.70,0:40:19.41,ENG,408,0,0,0,,René? Your nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.50,0:40:23.25,ENG,409,0,0,0,,Yes. He's so unlike his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.00,0:40:28.67,ENG,410,0,0,0,,He's a dreamer   imaginative.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.26,0:40:35.01,ENG,411,0,0,0,,He's so very gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.68,0:40:43.77,ENG,412,0,0,0,,What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.02,0:40:48.02,ENG,413,0,0,0,,Robert and René   they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.69,0:40:53.53,ENG,414,0,0,0,,Burned to death in a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.20,0:40:58.78,ENG,415,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry.  - It's all right. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.58,0:41:01.16,ENG,416,0,0,0,,These things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.25,0:41:05.37,ENG,417,0,0,0,,Captain   it's not all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.13,0:41:08.75,ENG,418,0,0,0,,I can't help thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.55,0:41:14.05,ENG,419,0,0,0,,all the experiences that René's not gonna have
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.30,0:41:18.97,ENG,420,0,0,0,,about going to the Academy   reading books and listening to music
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.72,0:41:21.72,ENG,421,0,0,0,,and falling in love
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.39,0:41:25.98,ENG,422,0,0,0,,building a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.15,0:41:33.74,ENG,423,0,0,0,,Well   that's not going to happen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.82,0:41:40.58,ENG,424,0,0,0,,I didn't realize he meant so much to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.91,0:41:45.04,ENG,425,0,0,0,,I'd come to feel that René was as close as I would get
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.12,0:41:47.25,ENG,426,0,0,0,,to having a child of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.68,0:42:03.64,ENG,427,0,0,0,,Your family history is very important to you   isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.77,0:42:04.85,ENG,428,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.02,0:42:13.03,ENG,429,0,0,0,,From being a small child
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.32,0:42:16.45,ENG,430,0,0,0,,I can remember being told about the family line.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.65,0:42:19.11,ENG,431,0,0,0,,The Picard who fought at Trafalgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.49,0:42:22.53,ENG,432,0,0,0,,The Picard who won the Nobel Prize for Chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.04,0:42:26.37,ENG,433,0,0,0,,The Picards who settled the first Martian colonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.29,0:42:34.50,ENG,434,0,0,0,,And when Robert married and he had a son   I...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.01,0:42:39.34,ENG,435,0,0,0,,You felt it was no longer your responsibility
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.47,0:42:41.55,ENG,436,0,0,0,,to carry on the family line.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.06,0:42:46.68,ENG,437,0,0,0,,Right. Yes. That's it exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.36,0:42:54.98,ENG,438,0,0,0,,You know   Counselor   recently I've become very much aware
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.07,0:42:58.65,ENG,439,0,0,0,,that there were fewer days ahead than there are behind
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.74,0:43:04.83,ENG,440,0,0,0,,but I took some comfort from the fact that the family would go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.67,0:43:12.17,ENG,441,0,0,0,,But now there'll be no more Picards.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.68,0:43:27.77,ENG,442,0,0,0,,Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.85,0:43:30.52,ENG,443,0,0,0,,A quantum implosion has occurred within the Amargosa star.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.60,0:43:35.90,ENG,444,0,0,0,,- All nuclear fusion is breaking down.  - How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.03,0:43:37.82,ENG,445,0,0,0,,Sensor records show the observatory launched
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.90,0:43:40.57,ENG,446,0,0,0,,a solar probe into the sun a few moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.70,0:43:42.95,ENG,447,0,0,0,,The star is going to collapse in a matter of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.03,0:43:46.95,ENG,448,0,0,0,,Sir   the implosion has produced a level-12 shock wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.04,0:43:49.08,ENG,449,0,0,0,,That'll destroy everything in this system.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.21,0:43:50.54,ENG,450,0,0,0,,Transporter Room to Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.62,0:43:53.54,ENG,451,0,0,0,,I can't locate Commander La Forge or Mr. Data   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.63,0:43:57.63,ENG,452,0,0,0,,- Have they come back to the ship?  - No   sir. They are not on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.92,0:44:00.80,ENG,453,0,0,0,,How long before the shock wave hits the observatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.88,0:44:02.63,ENG,454,0,0,0,,Four minutes   40 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.80,0:44:03.97,ENG,455,0,0,0,,Number One.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.05,0:44:06.05,ENG,456,0,0,0,,- Mr. Worf!  - Aye   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.74,0:44:21.15,ENG,457,0,0,0,,Soran   transmit your coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.42,0:44:38.30,ENG,458,0,0,0,,What the hell's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.42,0:44:42.38,ENG,459,0,0,0,,Enterprise to Commander Riker. You have two minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.47,0:44:44.26,ENG,460,0,0,0,,You hear that   Soran?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.76,0:44:48.51,ENG,461,0,0,0,,We've got a level-12 shock wave coming in. We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.68,0:44:55.65,ENG,462,0,0,0,,Sir   a Klingon bird-of-prey is decloaking off the port bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.27,0:44:58.61,ENG,463,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.37,0:45:18.54,ENG,464,0,0,0,,- Data   see if you can get to Geordi.  - I cannot   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.46,0:45:22.38,ENG,465,0,0,0,,Prepare for transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.52,0:45:42.07,ENG,466,0,0,0,,- Commander Riker's team is aboard   sir.  - Helm   warp 1   engage!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.92,0:45:57.83,ENG,467,0,0,0,,You've done it   Soran.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.34,0:46:06.55,ENG,468,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.94,0:46:26.95,ENG,469,0,0,0,,I hope for your sake you were initiating a mating ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.57,0:46:29.36,ENG,470,0,0,0,,You got careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.45,0:46:32.70,ENG,471,0,0,0,,The Romulans came looking for their missing trilithium.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.79,0:46:38.08,ENG,472,0,0,0,,Impossible. We left no survivors on their outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.21,0:46:42.79,ENG,473,0,0,0,,They knew it was on the observatory. If the Enterprise hadn't intervened
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.88,0:46:44.55,ENG,474,0,0,0,,they would have found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.63,0:46:49.63,ENG,475,0,0,0,,They didn't find it! And now we have a weapon of unlimited power.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.14,0:46:55.97,ENG,476,0,0,0,,No   Lursa   I have the weapon   and if you ever want me to give it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.06,0:47:00.23,ENG,477,0,0,0,,I would advise you to be a little more careful in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.90,0:47:03.44,ENG,478,0,0,0,,Perhaps we are tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.15,0:47:09.11,ENG,479,0,0,0,,Without my research   the trilithium is worthless
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.99,0:47:14.78,ENG,480,0,0,0,,as are your plans to re-conquer the Klingon Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.17,0:47:25.92,ENG,481,0,0,0,,Set course for the Veridian system. Maximum warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.01,0:47:35.43,ENG,482,0,0,0,,He's an El-Aurian   over 300 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.93,0:47:39.27,ENG,483,0,0,0,,He lost his entire family when the Borg destroyed his planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.44,0:47:41.81,ENG,484,0,0,0,,Soran escaped with a handful of other refugees
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.27,0:47:44.44,ENG,485,0,0,0,,aboard a ship called the Lakul.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.52,0:47:48.28,ENG,486,0,0,0,,That ship was later destroyed by some kind of energy ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.36,0:47:52.61,ENG,487,0,0,0,,But Soran and 46 others were rescued by the Enterprise-B.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.70,0:47:54.74,ENG,488,0,0,0,,That was the mission where James Kirk was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.83,0:47:57.37,ENG,489,0,0,0,,I checked the passenger manifest of the Lakul.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.00,0:48:00.12,ENG,490,0,0,0,,Guess who else was on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.04,0:48:06.92,ENG,491,0,0,0,,Soran is a name I haven't heard for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.00,0:48:09.55,ENG,492,0,0,0,,- You remember him?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.68,0:48:16.39,ENG,493,0,0,0,,Guinan   it is very important that you tell me everything that you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.97,0:48:22.39,ENG,494,0,0,0,,We think that Soran has developed a weapon   a terrible weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.02,0:48:25.69,ENG,495,0,0,0,,one that might even give him enough power to destroy an entire...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.82,0:48:28.82,ENG,496,0,0,0,,Soran doesn't care about weapons or power.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.65,0:48:32.61,ENG,497,0,0,0,,He just cares about getting back to the Nexus.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.70,0:48:34.32,ENG,498,0,0,0,,What is the Nexus?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.24,0:48:38.70,ENG,499,0,0,0,,The energy ribbon that destroyed that ship
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.25,0:48:43.04,ENG,500,0,0,0,,was not just some random phenomena traveling through the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.17,0:48:47.50,ENG,501,0,0,0,,It's a doorway to another place that we call the Nexus
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.59,0:48:51.17,ENG,502,0,0,0,,and it's a place I've tried very   very hard to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.76,0:49:00.43,ENG,503,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.02,0:49:08.02,ENG,504,0,0,0,,It was like being inside joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.61,0:49:11.32,ENG,505,0,0,0,,As if joy was something tangible
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.40,0:49:14.70,ENG,506,0,0,0,,and you could wrap yourself up in it like a blanket
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.12,0:49:20.79,ENG,507,0,0,0,,and never in my entire life have I ever been as content.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.46,0:49:24.29,ENG,508,0,0,0,,And then you were beamed away from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.37,0:49:27.63,ENG,509,0,0,0,,Pulled. Ripped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.71,0:49:30.55,ENG,510,0,0,0,,None of us wanted to go
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.38,0:49:35.26,ENG,511,0,0,0,,and I would have done anything   anything to get back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.26,0:49:41.18,ENG,512,0,0,0,,And once I realized that wasn't possible
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.27,0:49:43.06,ENG,513,0,0,0,,I learned to live with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.14,0:49:44.39,ENG,514,0,0,0,,What about Soran?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.48,0:49:48.15,ENG,515,0,0,0,,If he's still obsessed   he could be a very   very dangerous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.65,0:49:52.94,ENG,516,0,0,0,,Why would he destroy a star?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.62,0:50:00.49,ENG,517,0,0,0,,Thank you   Guinan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.91,0:50:05.91,ENG,518,0,0,0,,If you go
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.33,0:50:10.42,ENG,519,0,0,0,,you're not gonna care about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.75,0:50:15.26,ENG,520,0,0,0,,Not this ship   not Soran   not me. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.26,0:50:19.59,ENG,521,0,0,0,,All you'll want is to stay in the Nexus
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.35,0:50:24.02,ENG,522,0,0,0,,and you're not gonna want to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.12,0:50:41.83,ENG,523,0,0,0,,Marvelous technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.79,0:50:46.12,ENG,524,0,0,0,,This is a remarkable piece of equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.29,0:50:51.96,ENG,525,0,0,0,,- Glad you approve.  - It's not very stylish   though   is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.13,0:51:00.30,ENG,526,0,0,0,,Have you ever considered a prosthesis that would make you look a little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.97,0:51:04.14,ENG,527,0,0,0,,How can I say? More normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.47,0:51:07.48,ENG,528,0,0,0,,- What's normal?  - What's normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.81,0:51:10.15,ENG,529,0,0,0,,Well   that's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.98,0:51:14.82,ENG,530,0,0,0,,Normal is what everyone else is and you are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.15,0:51:22.20,ENG,531,0,0,0,,Can we just get down to it   please? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.70,0:51:27.75,ENG,532,0,0,0,,As you may or may not be aware   I am an El-Aurian.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.87,0:51:31.83,ENG,533,0,0,0,,Some people call us a race of listeners. We listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.59,0:51:38.26,ENG,534,0,0,0,,Right now   Mr. La Forge   you have my complete attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.72,0:51:43.18,ENG,535,0,0,0,,I want to listen to everything you know about trilithium.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.60,0:51:52.65,ENG,536,0,0,0,,Captain's Log   Stardate 48632.4. Dr. Crusher has informed me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.73,0:51:55.82,ENG,537,0,0,0,,that Data's emotion chip has been fused into his neural net
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.90,0:51:57.44,ENG,538,0,0,0,,and cannot be removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.53,0:51:59.36,ENG,539,0,0,0,,However   she believes he is fit for duty
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.45,0:52:02.78,ENG,540,0,0,0,,so I've asked him to join me in Stellar Cartography.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.70,0:52:08.04,ENG,541,0,0,0,,According to our information   the ribbon is a conflux of temporal energy
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.12,0:52:11.87,ENG,542,0,0,0,,which travels through this galaxy every 39.1 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.54,0:52:16.21,ENG,543,0,0,0,,It will pass through this sector in approximately 42 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.38,0:52:18.30,ENG,544,0,0,0,,Yes. Guinan was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.38,0:52:20.72,ENG,545,0,0,0,,She said that Soran was trying to get back to the ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.80,0:52:22.47,ENG,546,0,0,0,,Now   if that's true
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.55,0:52:25.72,ENG,547,0,0,0,,there has to be some connection with the Amargosa star.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.81,0:52:29.39,ENG,548,0,0,0,,Data   give me a list of anything that was affected by the star's destruction
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.48,0:52:31.10,ENG,549,0,0,0,,no matter how insignificant.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.44,0:52:35.06,ENG,550,0,0,0,,- Data?  - Sorry   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.73,0:52:42.40,ENG,551,0,0,0,,It will take the computer a few moments to compile the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.99,0:52:49.74,ENG,552,0,0,0,,Data   are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.79,0:52:57.34,ENG,553,0,0,0,,No   sir. I am finding it difficult to concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.75,0:53:04.09,ENG,554,0,0,0,,I believe I am overwhelmed with feelings of remorse
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.43,0:53:08.35,ENG,555,0,0,0,,and regret concerning my actions on the observatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.60,0:53:09.93,ENG,556,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.64,0:53:13.27,ENG,557,0,0,0,,I wanted to save Geordi
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.77,0:53:17.98,ENG,558,0,0,0,,but I experienced something I did not expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.82,0:53:22.19,ENG,559,0,0,0,,Fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.49,0:53:25.11,ENG,560,0,0,0,,I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.29,0:53:32.75,ENG,561,0,0,0,,According to our current information   the destruction of the Amargosa star
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.83,0:53:35.58,ENG,562,0,0,0,,has had the following effects in this sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.67,0:53:39.79,ENG,563,0,0,0,,Gamma emissions have increased by 0.05%.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.00,0:53:43.80,ENG,564,0,0,0,,The Starship Bozeman was forced to make a course correction.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.97,0:53:45.26,ENG,565,0,0,0,,Ambient magnetic fields...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.34,0:53:49.30,ENG,566,0,0,0,,Wait. The Bozeman   why would it make a course correction?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.47,0:53:51.10,ENG,567,0,0,0,,The destruction of the Amargosa star
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.18,0:53:54.43,ENG,568,0,0,0,,has altered the gravitational forces throughout this sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.52,0:53:56.73,ENG,569,0,0,0,,As a result   any ship passing through this region
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.81,0:53:59.36,ENG,570,0,0,0,,would have to make a minor course correction.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.48,0:54:03.48,ENG,571,0,0,0,,A minor course correction. Where's the ribbon now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.50,0:54:17.33,ENG,572,0,0,0,,- This is its current position.  - Can you project its course?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.55,0:54:24.01,ENG,573,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.18,0:54:32.64,ENG,574,0,0,0,,I cannot continue with this investigation. I wish to be deactivated
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.72,0:54:35.64,ENG,575,0,0,0,,until Dr. Crusher can remove the emotion chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.73,0:54:37.64,ENG,576,0,0,0,,Are you having some kind of malfunction?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.73,0:54:42.44,ENG,577,0,0,0,,No   sir. I simply do not have the ability to control these emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.36,0:54:46.53,ENG,578,0,0,0,,Data   I have nothing but sympathy for what you are feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.03,0:54:48.78,ENG,579,0,0,0,,but right now   I need you to...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.86,0:54:51.70,ENG,580,0,0,0,,Sir   I no longer want these emotions!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.03,0:54:55.37,ENG,581,0,0,0,,Deactivating me is the only viable solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.45,0:55:00.38,ENG,582,0,0,0,,Part of having feelings is learning to integrate them into your life   Data
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.58,0:55:01.88,ENG,583,0,0,0,,learning to live with them
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.04,0:55:03.71,ENG,584,0,0,0,,- no matter what the circumstances.  - Sir   I cannot!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.80,0:55:05.76,ENG,585,0,0,0,,You will not be deactivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.38,0:55:07.80,ENG,586,0,0,0,,You're an officer on board this ship
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.88,0:55:11.97,ENG,587,0,0,0,,and I require you to perform your duty. That is an order   Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.05,0:55:13.30,ENG,588,0,0,0,,Yes   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.23,0:55:18.89,ENG,589,0,0,0,,I will try   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.32,0:55:26.40,ENG,590,0,0,0,,Sometimes it takes courage to try   Data
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.40,0:55:29.90,ENG,591,0,0,0,,and courage can be an emotion   too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.95,0:55:33.91,ENG,592,0,0,0,,Now   can you project the course of the ribbon?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.66,0:55:36.24,ENG,593,0,0,0,,I believe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.17,0:55:42.92,ENG,594,0,0,0,,Enhance grid 9-A.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.26,0:55:48.67,ENG,595,0,0,0,,Where was the Amargosa star?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.30,0:55:54.72,ENG,596,0,0,0,,Now   you said that when the Amargosa star was destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.81,0:55:57.06,ENG,597,0,0,0,,it affected the gravitational forces in this sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.14,0:55:59.31,ENG,598,0,0,0,,Now   did the computer take that into account
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.48,0:56:01.27,ENG,599,0,0,0,,when it projected the course of the ribbon?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.35,0:56:04.31,ENG,600,0,0,0,,No   sir. I will make the appropriate adjustments.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.78,0:56:11.45,ENG,601,0,0,0,,That's what Soran's doing. He's changing the course of the ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.28,0:56:17.29,ENG,602,0,0,0,,But why? Why would he try to change its path?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.95,0:56:20.46,ENG,603,0,0,0,,Why doesn't he just fly into it with a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.62,0:56:23.08,ENG,604,0,0,0,,Our records show that every ship which has approached the ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.17,0:56:26.50,ENG,605,0,0,0,,has either been destroyed or severely damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.13,0:56:33.13,ENG,606,0,0,0,,He can't get to the ribbon   so he's trying to make the ribbon come to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.34,0:56:37.68,ENG,607,0,0,0,,Data   does it pass near to any M-Class planets?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.22,0:56:41.64,ENG,608,0,0,0,,Yes   sir. There are two in the Veridian system.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.39,0:56:46.52,ENG,609,0,0,0,,Well   it gets close to Veridian III   but not close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.02,0:56:51.65,ENG,610,0,0,0,,Data   what would happen to the ribbon's course
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.82,0:56:54.91,ENG,611,0,0,0,,if Soran destroyed the Veridian star itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.83,0:57:01.50,ENG,612,0,0,0,,That's where he's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.66,0:57:04.50,ENG,613,0,0,0,,It should be noted   sir
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.88,0:57:07.84,ENG,614,0,0,0,,that the collapse of the Veridian star would produce a shock wave
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.00,0:57:10.67,ENG,615,0,0,0,,similar to the one we observed at Amargosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.92,0:57:13.59,ENG,616,0,0,0,,Destroying all the planets in this system.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.22,0:57:18.51,ENG,617,0,0,0,,Veridian III is uninhabited.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.68,0:57:23.85,ENG,618,0,0,0,,However   Veridian IV supports a pre-industrial humanoid society.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.06,0:57:25.60,ENG,619,0,0,0,,Population?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.90,0:57:30.57,ENG,620,0,0,0,,Two hundred thirty million   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.36,0:57:35.11,ENG,621,0,0,0,,- Picard to Bridge.  - Worf here   sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.20,0:57:38.20,ENG,622,0,0,0,,Set a course for the Veridian system   maximum warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.23,0:58:07.23,ENG,623,0,0,0,,Did you get anything from the human?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.31,0:58:10.65,ENG,624,0,0,0,,No. His heart just wasn't in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.23,0:58:15.24,ENG,625,0,0,0,,We have entered orbit of Veridian III.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.57,0:58:24.08,ENG,626,0,0,0,,- Prepare to transport me to the surface.  - Wait. When do we get our payment?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.42,0:58:37.09,ENG,627,0,0,0,,This contains all the information you'll need to make a trilithium weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.09,0:58:40.93,ENG,628,0,0,0,,It's been coded.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.18,0:58:43.72,ENG,629,0,0,0,,Once I'm safely to the surface
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.81,0:58:46.89,ENG,630,0,0,0,,I'll transmit the decryption sequence to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.98,0:58:49.52,ENG,631,0,0,0,,- Not before.  - Mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.61,0:58:51.69,ENG,632,0,0,0,,A Federation starship is entering the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.77,0:58:54.11,ENG,633,0,0,0,,What? On viewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.65,0:58:56.82,ENG,634,0,0,0,,They're hailing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.99,0:59:00.16,ENG,635,0,0,0,,We're still cloaked. They can't see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.62,0:59:03.58,ENG,636,0,0,0,,Klingon vessel   we know what you are doing
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.66,0:59:07.46,ENG,637,0,0,0,,and we will destroy any probe launched toward the Veridian star.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.87,0:59:09.71,ENG,638,0,0,0,,We demand that you return our chief engineer
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.79,0:59:11.96,ENG,639,0,0,0,,and leave this system immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.13,0:59:15.63,ENG,640,0,0,0,,There's no time for this. Eliminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.88,0:59:20.05,ENG,641,0,0,0,,That is a Galaxy-class starship. We're no match for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.68,0:59:26.31,ENG,642,0,0,0,,I think it's time we gave Mr. La Forge his sight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.40,0:59:37.78,ENG,643,0,0,0,,Maybe they're not out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.86,0:59:41.20,ENG,644,0,0,0,,They're just trying to decide if a 20-year-old Klingon bird-of-prey
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.32,0:59:43.70,ENG,645,0,0,0,,can be a match for the Federation flagship.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.83,0:59:48.58,ENG,646,0,0,0,,- Perhaps they're on the surface.  - Sir   according to my calculations
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.66,0:59:51.87,ENG,647,0,0,0,,a solar probe launched from either the Klingon ship or the planet surface
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.00,0:59:53.71,ENG,648,0,0,0,,will take 11 seconds to reach the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.84,0:59:56.92,ENG,649,0,0,0,,However   since we do not have an exact point of origin
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.01,1:00:01.51,ENG,650,0,0,0,,it will take us between 8 and 15 seconds to lock our weapons onto it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.59,1:00:04.18,ENG,651,0,0,0,,- That's a pretty big margin of error.  - Much too big.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.43,1:00:06.39,ENG,652,0,0,0,,Mr. Data   how long before the ribbon arrives?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.56,1:00:08.52,ENG,653,0,0,0,,Approximately 47 minutes   sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.18,1:00:12.48,ENG,654,0,0,0,,We have got to find some way to get to Soran.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.56,1:00:15.69,ENG,655,0,0,0,,Klingon vessel decloaking directly ahead   sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.44,1:00:22.11,ENG,656,0,0,0,,- They are hailing.  - On screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.37,1:00:26.16,ENG,657,0,0,0,,Captain. What an unexpected pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.24,1:00:29.54,ENG,658,0,0,0,,Lursa   it is very important that I speak with Soran.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.79,1:00:32.87,ENG,659,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the doctor is no longer aboard our ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.46,1:00:38.55,ENG,660,0,0,0,,- Then I will beam to his location.  - The doctor values his privacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.71,1:00:43.13,ENG,661,0,0,0,,He would be quite upset if an armed away team interrupted him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.22,1:00:46.14,ENG,662,0,0,0,,Then I will beam to your ship and you can transport me to Soran.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.31,1:00:48.14,ENG,663,0,0,0,,We can't trust them. For all we know   they killed Geordi.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.22,1:00:49.52,ENG,664,0,0,0,,They might kill you   too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.60,1:00:54.81,ENG,665,0,0,0,,We did not harm your engineer. He's been our guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.90,1:00:55.98,ENG,666,0,0,0,,Then return him!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.06,1:01:00.28,ENG,667,0,0,0,,- In exchange for what?  - Me   sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.82,1:01:04.61,ENG,668,0,0,0,,Me. I will be your prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.74,1:01:06.37,ENG,669,0,0,0,,But first   you must beam me to the surface
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.45,1:01:08.24,ENG,670,0,0,0,,so that I can speak with Soran.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.33,1:01:13.66,ENG,671,0,0,0,,The Captain would make a much more valuable hostage.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.08,1:01:19.67,ENG,672,0,0,0,,- We'll consider it a prisoner exchange.  - Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.09,1:01:25.26,ENG,673,0,0,0,,Have Dr. Crusher meet me in Transporter Room 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.34,1:01:27.01,ENG,674,0,0,0,,You have the Bridge   Number One.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.48,1:01:35.31,ENG,675,0,0,0,,- Receiving the coordinates   Captain.  - Energize.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.89,1:02:13.64,ENG,676,0,0,0,,Welcome   Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.57,1:02:28.36,ENG,677,0,0,0,,- You must think I'm quite the madman.  - The thought had crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.16,1:02:30.66,ENG,678,0,0,0,,I know why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.74,1:02:35.08,ENG,679,0,0,0,,You're not entirely confident you can shoot down my probe
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.16,1:02:41.34,ENG,680,0,0,0,,so you've come to dissuade me from my horrific plan. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.59,1:02:46.55,ENG,681,0,0,0,,Now   if you'll excuse me   Captain   I'm rather busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.93,1:02:49.18,ENG,682,0,0,0,,Soran.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.73,1:03:00.35,ENG,683,0,0,0,,Do be careful   Captain. That's a 50-gigawatt force field.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.44,1:03:02.27,ENG,684,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want to see you get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.61,1:03:05.03,ENG,685,0,0,0,,I have established the link.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.20,1:03:09.07,ENG,686,0,0,0,,Put it on viewer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.03,1:03:13.87,ENG,687,0,0,0,,It's working. The visor's transmitting.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.87,1:03:16.25,ENG,688,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.63,1:03:29.22,ENG,689,0,0,0,,Human females are so repulsive.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.39,1:03:33.05,ENG,690,0,0,0,,...and some myocardial degeneration.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.39,1:03:36.72,ENG,691,0,0,0,,I've removed the nanoprobe   and I think you're going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.81,1:03:39.14,ENG,692,0,0,0,,I'll need to run some more tests. I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.23,1:03:40.73,ENG,693,0,0,0,,Thanks   Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.48,1:03:47.11,ENG,694,0,0,0,,- Geordi...  - Data   it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.94,1:03:50.28,ENG,695,0,0,0,,I am sorry I let you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.74,1:03:53.91,ENG,696,0,0,0,,I have not been behaving like myself lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.99,1:03:58.66,ENG,697,0,0,0,,No   Data   you haven't. You've been behaving like a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.02,1:04:20.35,ENG,698,0,0,0,,You don't have to do this   Soran.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.77,1:04:24.61,ENG,699,0,0,0,,I'm sure we can find another way of getting you into this Nexus.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.27,1:04:28.69,ENG,700,0,0,0,,I've spent 80 years looking for another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.69,1:04:32.61,ENG,701,0,0,0,,Believe me   this is the only one.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.95,1:04:41.62,ENG,702,0,0,0,,What you're about to do   Soran   is no different
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.71,1:04:44.54,ENG,703,0,0,0,,from when the Borg destroyed your world.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.79,1:04:47.04,ENG,704,0,0,0,,They killed millions   too
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.63,1:04:51.38,ENG,705,0,0,0,,including your wife   children.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.68,1:05:00.31,ENG,706,0,0,0,,Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.02,1:05:09.57,ENG,707,0,0,0,,You know   there was a time when I wouldn't hurt a fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.24,1:05:12.07,ENG,708,0,0,0,,Then the Borg came
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.41,1:05:18.74,ENG,709,0,0,0,,and they showed me that if there is one constant in this whole universe
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.16,1:05:20.54,ENG,710,0,0,0,,it's death.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.33,1:05:24.62,ENG,711,0,0,0,,Afterwards   I began to realize it didn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.71,1:05:28.84,ENG,712,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die sometime. It's just a question of how and when.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.42,1:05:31.17,ENG,713,0,0,0,,You will   too   Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.01,1:05:35.68,ENG,714,0,0,0,,Aren't you beginning to feel time gaining on you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.26,1:05:42.73,ENG,715,0,0,0,,It's like a predator. It's stalking you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.69,1:05:50.52,ENG,716,0,0,0,,You can try and outrun it with doctors   medicines   new technologies
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.90,1:05:55.86,ENG,717,0,0,0,,but in the end   time is going to hunt you down and make the kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.24,1:06:01.37,ENG,718,0,0,0,,It's our mortality that defines us   Soran. It's part of the truth of our existence.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.79,1:06:09.96,ENG,719,0,0,0,,- What if I told you I found a new truth?  - The Nexus?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.09,1:06:15.97,ENG,720,0,0,0,,Time has no meaning there. The predator has no teeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.59,1:06:20.80,ENG,721,0,0,0,,- Where is he now?  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.89,1:06:24.06,ENG,722,0,0,0,,He bathed. Now he's roaming the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.31,1:06:27.39,ENG,723,0,0,0,,He must be the only engineer in Starfleet
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.48,1:06:29.73,ENG,724,0,0,0,,who doesn't go to Engineering.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.15,1:06:34.49,ENG,725,0,0,0,,- Any luck   Mr. Worf?  - No   sir. I still cannot locate the Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.66,1:06:39.62,ENG,726,0,0,0,,Data   the sensors can't penetrate the planet's ionosphere.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.74,1:06:40.82,ENG,727,0,0,0,,There's too much interference.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.91,1:06:42.79,ENG,728,0,0,0,,Can you find a way to scan for life-forms?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.91,1:06:44.66,ENG,729,0,0,0,,I would be happy to   sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.29,1:06:49.33,ENG,730,0,0,0,,I just love scanning for life-forms.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.29,1:06:53.42,ENG,731,0,0,0,,Life-forms
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.09,1:06:57.01,ENG,732,0,0,0,,You tiny little life-forms
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.01,1:07:01.18,ENG,733,0,0,0,,You precious little life-forms
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.97,1:07:03.97,ENG,734,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.82,1:07:13.02,ENG,735,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.32,1:07:18.15,ENG,736,0,0,0,,Commander   I'd like to run a level 3 diagnostic on the port plasma relays.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.28,1:07:19.91,ENG,737,0,0,0,,I think one of the generators is fluctuating.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.99,1:07:21.45,ENG,738,0,0,0,,Fine. Let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.71,1:07:37.21,ENG,739,0,0,0,,That's it! Replay from time index 924.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.35,1:07:45.85,ENG,740,0,0,0,,Magnify this section and enhance.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.23,1:07:55.02,ENG,741,0,0,0,,Their shields are operating on a modulation of 257.4.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.15,1:07:58.24,ENG,742,0,0,0,,Adjust our torpedo frequency to match. 257.4.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.25,1:08:12.33,ENG,743,0,0,0,,They have found a way to penetrate our shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.42,1:08:14.04,ENG,744,0,0,0,,Lock phasers and return fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.68,1:08:24.55,ENG,745,0,0,0,,Deanna   take the helm. Get us out of orbit!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.68,1:08:27.43,ENG,746,0,0,0,,Hull breach on Decks 31 through 35.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.10,1:08:36.36,ENG,747,0,0,0,,Mr. Worf   what do we know about that old Klingon ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.44,1:08:39.78,ENG,748,0,0,0,,- Any weaknesses?  - It's a Class-D12 bird-of-prey.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.86,1:08:42.65,ENG,749,0,0,0,,They were retired from service because of defective plasma coils.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.74,1:08:45.16,ENG,750,0,0,0,,Plasma coils? Is there any way we can use that to our advantage?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.24,1:08:49.37,ENG,751,0,0,0,,I do not see how. The plasma coil is part of their cloaking device.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.04,1:08:57.75,ENG,752,0,0,0,,Let's get a stabilizer on that conduit.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.80,1:09:01.72,ENG,753,0,0,0,,Reinforce that starboard interlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.80,1:09:04.09,ENG,754,0,0,0,,We need to re-route main power through the secondary coupling.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.89,1:09:09.89,ENG,755,0,0,0,,Data   would a defective plasma coil be susceptible to some sort of ionic pulse?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.97,1:09:13.81,ENG,756,0,0,0,,Perhaps. Yes   yes. If we sent a low-level ionic pulse
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.90,1:09:16.15,ENG,757,0,0,0,,it might reset the coil and trigger their cloaking device.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.23,1:09:18.32,ENG,758,0,0,0,,Excellent idea   sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.98,1:09:21.28,ENG,759,0,0,0,,As their cloak begins to engage   their shields will drop.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.40,1:09:23.78,ENG,760,0,0,0,,They'll have two seconds of vulnerability. Mr. Data
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.91,1:09:26.41,ENG,761,0,0,0,,- lock on to plasma coil.  - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.08,1:09:33.75,ENG,762,0,0,0,,- Our shields are holding.  - Fire at will.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.92,1:09:37.75,ENG,763,0,0,0,,Mr. Worf   prepare a spread of photon torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.84,1:09:39.59,ENG,764,0,0,0,,We have to hit them the instant they begin to cloak.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.67,1:09:41.84,ENG,765,0,0,0,,- Aye   sir.  - We get one shot at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.01,1:09:43.59,ENG,766,0,0,0,,Target their primary reactor.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.68,1:09:52.60,ENG,767,0,0,0,,I have accessed their core frequency. Initiating ionic pulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.68,1:09:54.27,ENG,768,0,0,0,,Make it quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.61,1:10:05.57,ENG,769,0,0,0,,- Target their bridge.  - Full disruptors.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.66,1:10:07.07,ENG,770,0,0,0,,- We are cloaking.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.16,1:10:08.78,ENG,771,0,0,0,,Our shields are down!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.37,1:10:14.45,ENG,772,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.99,1:10:48.24,ENG,773,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.20,1:11:34.79,ENG,774,0,0,0,,Haven't you got anything better to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.33,1:12:20.54,ENG,775,0,0,0,,Must have been that last torpedo. La Forge to Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.62,1:12:21.96,ENG,776,0,0,0,,I've got a problem down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.08,1:12:24.58,ENG,777,0,0,0,,The magnetic interlocks have been ruptured. I...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.13,1:12:30.17,ENG,778,0,0,0,,Coolant leak! We have a coolant leak   everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.26,1:12:31.34,ENG,779,0,0,0,,Let's go. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.43,1:12:35.26,ENG,780,0,0,0,,Everybody out. Let's move! Let's move! We've gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.60,1:12:36.76,ENG,781,0,0,0,,- Quick!  - Evacuate! Evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.85,1:12:38.35,ENG,782,0,0,0,,Bridge   we have a new problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.43,1:12:40.18,ENG,783,0,0,0,,We're five minutes from a warp core breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.27,1:12:41.69,ENG,784,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.15,1:12:46.77,ENG,785,0,0,0,,Deanna   evacuate everyone to the saucer section.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.86,1:12:49.53,ENG,786,0,0,0,,Mr. Data   prepare to separate the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.03,1:12:56.32,ENG,787,0,0,0,,Starship separation in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.45,1:13:00.29,ENG,788,0,0,0,,- We're going straight down.  - Everyone move. Take Corridor A.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.38,1:13:09.63,ENG,789,0,0,0,,Starship separation in four minutes   45 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.18,1:13:17.14,ENG,790,0,0,0,,All right   let's move him out. Let's go. Take him out   quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.56,1:13:23.81,ENG,791,0,0,0,,Starship separation in four minutes   30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.40,1:13:27.40,ENG,792,0,0,0,,- Keep moving   everyone. Keep going.  - Here we go   Rose   this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.49,1:13:33.65,ENG,793,0,0,0,,Starship separation in four minutes   15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.74,1:13:35.03,ENG,794,0,0,0,,- Hurry!  - Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.03,1:13:38.16,ENG,795,0,0,0,,- Farrell!  - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.08,1:13:41.91,ENG,796,0,0,0,,There's no one here with these kids. Let's get them to the Jefferies tube.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.00,1:13:44.25,ENG,797,0,0,0,,- Come on   sweetie.  - We'll find their parents later.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.42,1:13:48.00,ENG,798,0,0,0,,Starship separation in four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.07,1:14:20.62,ENG,799,0,0,0,,Now you'll have to excuse me   Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.70,1:14:25.87,ENG,800,0,0,0,,I have an appointment with eternity   and I don't want to be late.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.97,1:14:46.10,ENG,801,0,0,0,,The core breach is accelerating   Geordi. We've gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.98,1:14:50.98,ENG,802,0,0,0,,- That's it   Bridge. We're all out.  - One minute to warp core breach.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.07,1:14:54.32,ENG,803,0,0,0,,Begin separation sequence. Full impulse power once we're clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.40,1:14:55.78,ENG,804,0,0,0,,Warp core is going critical.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.92,1:15:13.96,ENG,805,0,0,0,,- Separation complete.  - Engaging impulse engines.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.42,1:15:16.42,ENG,806,0,0,0,,Core breach in progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.43,1:15:27.52,ENG,807,0,0,0,,Primary stabilizers off-line. Engaging secondary systems.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.19,1:15:35.61,ENG,808,0,0,0,,- Report!  - Helm controls are off-line!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.28,1:15:44.33,ENG,809,0,0,0,,Oh   shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.25,1:16:34.33,ENG,810,0,0,0,,Here we go. Right around this corner!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.17,1:16:38.17,ENG,811,0,0,0,,Come and help me. Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.55,1:16:40.88,ENG,812,0,0,0,,Just keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.01,1:16:43.34,ENG,813,0,0,0,,- On the ground.  - Everybody on the bed!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.39,1:16:52.77,ENG,814,0,0,0,,I have re-routed auxiliary power to the lateral thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.85,1:16:55.02,ENG,815,0,0,0,,Attempting to level our descent.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.36,1:16:57.27,ENG,816,0,0,0,,All hands   brace for impact!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.36,1:17:04.86,ENG,817,0,0,0,,- Hold on   everybody. Hold on tight.  - Hold their heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.52,1:18:57.06,ENG,818,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.19,1:22:32.69,ENG,819,0,0,0,,What... What is this? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.88,1:22:52.88,ENG,820,0,0,0,,- Surprise!  - We love you   Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.05,1:22:55.38,ENG,821,0,0,0,,- Were you scared?  - Look at the tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.47,1:22:58.47,ENG,822,0,0,0,,- I helped decorate it.  - It took all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.55,1:23:01.01,ENG,823,0,0,0,,- Say   "Merry Christmas  " Papa.  - See the presents?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.10,1:23:03.47,ENG,824,0,0,0,,- I love you   Father.  - I love you   too.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.72,1:23:07.89,ENG,825,0,0,0,,Come on   children. Let's move back and give your father some room.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.99,1:23:24.41,ENG,826,0,0,0,,- Cup of Earl Grey?  - That would be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.30,1:23:37.13,ENG,827,0,0,0,,- This one's for you.  - Thank you very much   René.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.18,1:23:40.84,ENG,828,0,0,0,,- Merry Christmas   Uncle.  - And Merry Christmas to you   too.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.93,1:23:43.35,ENG,829,0,0,0,,René   can you help me with the table?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.18,1:23:46.60,ENG,830,0,0,0,,René!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.94,1:23:50.19,ENG,831,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.12,1:24:08.79,ENG,832,0,0,0,,Go help your aunt.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.85,1:24:25.56,ENG,833,0,0,0,,Did you get anything else?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.43,1:25:52.23,ENG,834,0,0,0,,This isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.77,1:25:57.81,ENG,835,0,0,0,,- This can't be real.  - It's as real as you want it to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.90,1:26:02.82,ENG,836,0,0,0,,Guinan   what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.07,1:26:07.57,ENG,837,0,0,0,,- Why am I here?  - You're in the Nexus.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.08,1:26:14.41,ENG,838,0,0,0,,- This is the Nexus?  - For you. This is what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.62,1:26:20.63,ENG,839,0,0,0,,But I never had a home like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.42,1:26:28.43,ENG,840,0,0,0,,Nor a wife and children   but these are all mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.31,1:26:34.68,ENG,841,0,0,0,,Guinan   what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.44,1:26:37.40,ENG,842,0,0,0,,I thought you were on board the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.48,1:26:40.27,ENG,843,0,0,0,,I am. I'm also here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.36,1:26:45.44,ENG,844,0,0,0,,Think of me as an echo of the person you know
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.03,1:26:48.66,ENG,845,0,0,0,,a part of herself she left behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.78,1:26:51.78,ENG,846,0,0,0,,When the Enterprise-B beamed you up from the Lakul.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.87,1:26:57.00,ENG,847,0,0,0,,- Papa   help me build my castle.  - Yes   I will in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.83,1:27:04.71,ENG,848,0,0,0,,Papa   thank you for the dolly. She's very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.30,1:27:13.56,ENG,849,0,0,0,,These are my children. These are my children.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.85,1:27:17.23,ENG,850,0,0,0,,Of course. Time has no meaning here
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.02,1:27:20.15,ENG,851,0,0,0,,so you can go back and see them born
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.23,1:27:23.86,ENG,852,0,0,0,,or go forward and see your grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.53,1:27:27.03,ENG,853,0,0,0,,Dinner's ready   everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.15,1:27:28.36,ENG,854,0,0,0,,- Yay!  - Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.82,1:27:31.37,ENG,855,0,0,0,,Mama   can I...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.70,1:27:35.33,ENG,856,0,0,0,,- Dinner's ready   Papa.  - Yes   of course. Come on   Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.41,1:27:37.04,ENG,857,0,0,0,,It's your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.90,1:28:08.40,ENG,858,0,0,0,,Go on. Go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.38,1:28:33.09,ENG,859,0,0,0,,Guinan   can I leave the Nexus?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.43,1:28:36.72,ENG,860,0,0,0,,- Where would you go?  - I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.06,1:28:39.60,ENG,861,0,0,0,,Well   as I said   time has no meaning here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.73,1:28:43.56,ENG,862,0,0,0,,So   if you leave   you can go anywhere   any time.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.15,1:28:46.11,ENG,863,0,0,0,,All right   I know exactly where I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.23,1:28:50.11,ENG,864,0,0,0,,To the mountaintop on Veridian III just before Soran destroyed the star.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.24,1:28:53.91,ENG,865,0,0,0,,I have to stop him   but I need help.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.24,1:28:55.99,ENG,866,0,0,0,,Now   if you were to come back with me   together...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.08,1:28:59.83,ENG,867,0,0,0,,I can't leave. I'm there already   remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.91,1:29:03.58,ENG,868,0,0,0,,But I bet I know someone who can.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.58,1:29:08.25,ENG,869,0,0,0,,And from his point of view   he just got here   too.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.31,1:29:18.64,ENG,870,0,0,0,,Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.60,1:29:22.69,ENG,871,0,0,0,,James T. Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.94,1:29:29.48,ENG,872,0,0,0,,Beautiful day.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.95,1:29:34.78,ENG,873,0,0,0,,Yes   it certainly is.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.62,1:29:44.17,ENG,874,0,0,0,,Would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.80,1:29:59.14,ENG,875,0,0,0,,Captain   I'm wondering   do you realize...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.22,1:30:02.35,ENG,876,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute. Do you smell something burning?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.15,1:30:18.41,ENG,877,0,0,0,,Looks like somebody was trying to cook some eggs. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.99,1:30:22.87,ENG,878,0,0,0,,It's all right. It's my house.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.88,1:30:28.33,ENG,879,0,0,0,,At least it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.25,1:30:31.84,ENG,880,0,0,0,,I sold it years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.88,1:30:39.18,ENG,881,0,0,0,,I'm Captain Jean-Luc Picard of the Starship Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.68,1:30:44.06,ENG,882,0,0,0,,The clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.52,1:30:50.52,ENG,883,0,0,0,,I gave this clock to Bones.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.86,1:30:56.28,ENG,884,0,0,0,,I'm from what you would consider the future   the 24th century.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.45,1:31:01.74,ENG,885,0,0,0,,Butler!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.58,1:31:07.75,ENG,886,0,0,0,,Butler.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.04,1:31:11.54,ENG,887,0,0,0,,How can you be here?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.26,1:31:15.09,ENG,888,0,0,0,,He's been dead seven years.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.38,1:31:17.88,ENG,889,0,0,0,,Come on   Jim. I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.97,1:31:21.55,ENG,890,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna be rattling around in that kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.81,1:31:23.22,ENG,891,0,0,0,,Antonia.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.89,1:31:30.98,ENG,892,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? The future?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.73,1:31:34.40,ENG,893,0,0,0,,This is the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.57,1:31:38.57,ENG,894,0,0,0,,This is nine years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.25,1:31:58.26,ENG,895,0,0,0,,The day I told her I was going back to Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.85,1:32:12.35,ENG,896,0,0,0,,And these are Ktarian eggs   her favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.44,1:32:14.98,ENG,897,0,0,0,,I was preparing them to soften the blow.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.94,1:32:20.82,ENG,898,0,0,0,,I know how real this must seem to you   but it's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.95,1:32:23.99,ENG,899,0,0,0,,This isn't really your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.12,1:32:27.79,ENG,900,0,0,0,,We are both of us caught up in some kind of temporal nexus.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.71,1:32:32.46,ENG,901,0,0,0,,- Dill.  - I beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.54,1:32:35.63,ENG,902,0,0,0,,Dill weed. In the cabinet   second shelf to the left.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.55,1:32:39.30,ENG,903,0,0,0,,Behind the oregano.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.22,1:32:50.02,ENG,904,0,0,0,,- How long have you been here?  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.19,1:32:56.11,ENG,905,0,0,0,,I was aboard the Enterprise-B in the Deflector Control Room and...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.19,1:32:57.98,ENG,906,0,0,0,,Stir these   will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.49,1:32:59.99,ENG,907,0,0,0,,The bulkhead in front of me disappeared
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.07,1:33:02.86,ENG,908,0,0,0,,and then I found myself out there   just now   chopping wood
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.99,1:33:05.16,ENG,909,0,0,0,,right before you walked up.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.16,1:33:07.49,ENG,910,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.83,1:33:12.37,ENG,911,0,0,0,,Look   history records
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.87,1:33:18.21,ENG,912,0,0,0,,that you died saving the Enterprise-B from an energy ribbon 80 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.22,1:33:22.59,ENG,913,0,0,0,,You say this is the 24th century?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.72,1:33:27.55,ENG,914,0,0,0,,- And I'm dead?  - Not exactly. As I said
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.68,1:33:31.18,ENG,915,0,0,0,,- this is some kind of temporal nexus.  - Temporal nexus   yes   I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.89,1:33:35.06,ENG,916,0,0,0,,- I...  - Something is missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.90,1:33:45.41,ENG,917,0,0,0,,Captain   look   I need your help. I want you to leave the Nexus with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.24,1:33:50.16,ENG,918,0,0,0,,We have to go back to a planet   Veridian III.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.25,1:33:53.08,ENG,919,0,0,0,,We have to stop a man called Soran from destroying a star.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.12,1:33:56.42,ENG,920,0,0,0,,Millions of lives are at stake.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.46,1:34:01.59,ENG,921,0,0,0,,You say history considers me dead. Who am I to argue with history?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.72,1:34:04.13,ENG,922,0,0,0,,You're a Starfleet officer! You have a duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.22,1:34:06.01,ENG,923,0,0,0,,I don't need to be lectured by you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.09,1:34:09.97,ENG,924,0,0,0,,I was out saving the galaxy when your grandfather was in diapers.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.39,1:34:12.81,ENG,925,0,0,0,,Besides which   I think the galaxy owes me one.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.23,1:34:18.44,ENG,926,0,0,0,,Oh   yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.78,1:34:24.32,ENG,927,0,0,0,,I was like you once
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.40,1:34:28.78,ENG,928,0,0,0,,so worried about duty and obligation I couldn't see past my own uniform.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.24,1:34:35.75,ENG,929,0,0,0,,And what did it get me? An empty house.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.51,1:34:44.01,ENG,930,0,0,0,,Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.80,1:34:50.26,ENG,931,0,0,0,,This time I'm gonna walk up these stairs   march into that bedroom
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.35,1:34:53.56,ENG,932,0,0,0,,and tell Antonia I want to marry her.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.64,1:34:56.44,ENG,933,0,0,0,,This time it's gonna be different.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.01,1:35:29.51,ENG,934,0,0,0,,- This is not your bedroom.  - No   it's not. It's better.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.89,1:35:34.56,ENG,935,0,0,0,,- Better?  - This is my uncle's barn in Idaho.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.64,1:35:39.98,ENG,936,0,0,0,,I took this horse out for a ride 11 years ago on a spring day.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.98,1:35:50.41,ENG,937,0,0,0,,Like this one. If I'm right   this is the day I met Antonia.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.16,1:35:53.74,ENG,938,0,0,0,,This Nexus of yours   very clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.20,1:35:58.16,ENG,939,0,0,0,,I can start all over again and do things right from day one.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.43,1:37:39.10,ENG,940,0,0,0,,I must have jumped that 50 times. Scared the hell out of me each time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.93,1:37:41.60,ENG,941,0,0,0,,Except this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.44,1:37:45.31,ENG,942,0,0,0,,Because it isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.78,1:37:51.11,ENG,943,0,0,0,,Antonia.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.20,1:37:53.99,ENG,944,0,0,0,,She isn't real either   is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.61,1:37:58.45,ENG,945,0,0,0,,Nothing here is. Nothing here matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.29,1:38:03.12,ENG,946,0,0,0,,You know   maybe this isn't about an empty house.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.21,1:38:07.13,ENG,947,0,0,0,,Maybe it's about that empty chair on the Bridge of the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.46,1:38:13.47,ENG,948,0,0,0,,Ever since I left Starfleet   I haven't made a difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.64,1:38:27.35,ENG,949,0,0,0,,- Captain of the Enterprise?  - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.36,1:38:30.32,ENG,950,0,0,0,,Close to retirement?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.65,1:38:33.69,ENG,951,0,0,0,,- I'm not planning on it.  - Let me tell you something. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.65,1:38:37.20,ENG,952,0,0,0,,Don't let them promote you. Don't let them transfer you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.32,1:38:41.08,ENG,953,0,0,0,,Don't let them do anything that takes you off the Bridge of that ship
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.16,1:38:44.87,ENG,954,0,0,0,,because while you're there you can make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.21,1:38:49.63,ENG,955,0,0,0,,Come back with me. Help me stop Soran.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.71,1:38:51.84,ENG,956,0,0,0,,Make a difference again.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.43,1:39:07.31,ENG,957,0,0,0,,Who am I to argue with the captain of the Enterprise?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.40,1:39:08.44,ENG,958,0,0,0,,What's the name of that planet?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.52,1:39:10.69,ENG,959,0,0,0,,- Veridian III?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.77,1:39:13.98,ENG,960,0,0,0,,I take it the odds are against us and the situation is grim.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.07,1:39:15.74,ENG,961,0,0,0,,You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.70,1:39:18.78,ENG,962,0,0,0,,You know   if Spock were here
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.87,1:39:23.20,ENG,963,0,0,0,,he'd say that I was an irrational   illogical human being
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.29,1:39:25.70,ENG,964,0,0,0,,for taking on a mission like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.37,1:39:30.04,ENG,965,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.39,1:39:48.02,ENG,966,0,0,0,,I have re-routed auxiliary power to the lateral thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.10,1:39:50.23,ENG,967,0,0,0,,Attempting to level our descent.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.44,1:39:52.56,ENG,968,0,0,0,,All hands   brace for impact!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.82,1:40:39.86,ENG,969,0,0,0,,- Just who the hell are you?  - He's James T. Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.28,1:40:43.28,ENG,970,0,0,0,,Don't you read history?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.54,1:40:50.79,ENG,971,0,0,0,,I've gotta get to the launcher.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.79,1:40:55.67,ENG,972,0,0,0,,- The ribbon will be here in a minute.  - I'll take care of Soran.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.67,1:41:35.33,ENG,973,0,0,0,,Actually   I am familiar with history   Captain
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.42,1:41:38.55,ENG,974,0,0,0,,and if I'm not too much mistaken   you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.01,1:42:23.30,ENG,975,0,0,0,,I thought you were heading for the launcher.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.38,1:42:26.38,ENG,976,0,0,0,,I changed my mind. Captain's prerogative.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.66,1:42:52.66,ENG,977,0,0,0,,We need that control pad.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.09,1:43:00.63,ENG,978,0,0,0,,Captain   look.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.30,1:43:04.84,ENG,979,0,0,0,,Where's Soran?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.49,1:44:11.49,ENG,980,0,0,0,,We're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.57,1:44:15.24,ENG,981,0,0,0,,Look   the control pad   it's still on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.33,1:44:17.12,ENG,982,0,0,0,,I'll get it. You go for the launcher.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.20,1:44:20.00,ENG,983,0,0,0,,No   you'll never make that by yourself. We have to work together.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.08,1:44:23.17,ENG,984,0,0,0,,We are working together. Trust me. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.25,1:44:25.67,ENG,985,0,0,0,,- Good luck   Captain.  - Call me Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.68,1:46:02.10,ENG,986,0,0,0,,Picard!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.85,1:46:06.02,ENG,987,0,0,0,,Get away from that launcher.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.82,1:46:11.19,ENG,988,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.83,1:47:53.55,ENG,989,0,0,0,,Did we do it? Did we make a difference?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.05,1:47:59.30,ENG,990,0,0,0,,Yes. We made a difference. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.52,1:48:10.40,ENG,991,0,0,0,,The least I could do for the captain of the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.61,1:48:23.16,ENG,992,0,0,0,,It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.63,1:48:36.00,ENG,993,0,0,0,,Oh   my.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.30,1:50:02.97,ENG,994,0,0,0,,Captain's Log   Stardate 48650.1.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.05,1:50:05.51,ENG,995,0,0,0,,Three Starfleet vessels have arrived in orbit
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.59,1:50:08.30,ENG,996,0,0,0,,and have begun to beam up the Enterprise survivors.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.39,1:50:09.85,ENG,997,0,0,0,,Our casualties were light
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.93,1:50:14.19,ENG,998,0,0,0,,but unfortunately   the Enterprise herself cannot be salvaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.69,1:50:17.23,ENG,999,0,0,0,,It has been extremely difficult   Counselor.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.31,1:50:21.19,ENG,1000,0,0,0,,Well   then   why did you decide not to remove the emotion chip?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.28,1:50:25.95,ENG,1001,0,0,0,,At first   I was unprepared for the unpredictable nature of emotions.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.70,1:50:31.45,ENG,1002,0,0,0,,However   having experienced 261 distinct emotional states
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.91,1:50:34.79,ENG,1003,0,0,0,,I believe I have learned to control my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.87,1:50:37.25,ENG,1004,0,0,0,,They will no longer control me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.58,1:50:39.75,ENG,1005,0,0,0,,Well   I hope you're successful   Data.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.88,1:50:44.01,ENG,1006,0,0,0,,Data   over here. I found something.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.76,1:50:47.76,ENG,1007,0,0,0,,One life sign   very faint.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.69,1:51:03.11,ENG,1008,0,0,0,,Spot!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.90,1:51:09.32,ENG,1009,0,0,0,,I'm very happy to see you   Spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.91,1:51:13.91,ENG,1010,0,0,0,,Another family reunited.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.96,1:51:20.67,ENG,1011,0,0,0,,Data   are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.13,1:51:25.80,ENG,1012,0,0,0,,I am uncertain   Counselor.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.88,1:51:30.47,ENG,1013,0,0,0,,I am happy to see Spot   yet I am crying.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.43,1:51:35.98,ENG,1014,0,0,0,,Perhaps the chip is malfunctioning.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.73,1:51:40.06,ENG,1015,0,0,0,,I think it's working perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.95,1:51:49.03,ENG,1016,0,0,0,,Hello   Spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.62,1:51:57.04,ENG,1017,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.83,1:52:03.04,ENG,1018,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes   that's it   Number One. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.39,1:52:13.43,ENG,1019,0,0,0,,I'm gonna miss this ship. She went before her time.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.77,1:52:22.65,ENG,1020,0,0,0,,Someone once told me that time was a predator that stalked us all our lives
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.73,1:52:25.57,ENG,1021,0,0,0,,but I rather believe that time is a companion
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.65,1:52:27.86,ENG,1022,0,0,0,,who goes with us on the journey
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.95,1:52:34.03,ENG,1023,0,0,0,,reminds us to cherish every moment because they'll never come again.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.33,1:52:41.12,ENG,1024,0,0,0,,What we leave behind is not as important as how we've lived.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.79,1:52:45.63,ENG,1025,0,0,0,,After all   Number One   we're only mortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.05,1:52:50.30,ENG,1026,0,0,0,,Speak for yourself   sir. I plan to live forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.51,1:52:58.98,ENG,1027,0,0,0,,I always thought I'd get a shot at this chair one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.60,1:53:02.60,ENG,1028,0,0,0,,Perhaps you still will.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.94,1:53:05.98,ENG,1029,0,0,0,,Somehow   I doubt that this will be the last ship
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.07,1:53:08.32,ENG,1030,0,0,0,,to carry the name Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.54,1:53:19.79,ENG,1031,0,0,0,,Picard to Farragut. Two to beam up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:09.27,CHS,1,0,0,0,,重返企业号  觉得怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.35,0:03:10.85,CHS,2,0,0,0,,却克船长
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:13.44,CHS,3,0,0,0,,- 问几句话行吗?  - 你参加那次重新设计了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.82,CHS,4,0,0,0,,我们想知道在你在上面感觉如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:19.82,CHS,5,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:22.41,CHS,6,0,0,0,,稍后你们有充分时间发问
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:25.62,CHS,7,0,0,0,,在下夏利船长  欢迎欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:27.83,CHS,8,0,0,0,,- 我们很荣幸  - 我只是想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:29.54,CHS,9,0,0,0,,敝船首航 承蒙多位传奇人物莅临
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.79,0:03:33.71,CHS,10,0,0,0,,全体船员都增光不少
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:37.38,CHS,11,0,0,0,,还是学生时  我已久仰大名
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:38.59,CHS,12,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.01,0:03:45.60,CHS,13,0,0,0,,- 我们可否到处参观?  - 请不要客气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:47.97,CHS,14,0,0,0,,很高兴能见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.35,0:03:51.98,CHS,15,0,0,0,,- 慕拉  - 打扰一下  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:54.48,CHS,16,0,0,0,,请问  三十年来企业号的船长
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:57.52,CHS,17,0,0,0,,首次不是阁下  有何感想?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:03:59.82,CHS,18,0,0,0,,我乐于来恭贺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.65,CHS,19,0,0,0,,退休的生活怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.20,CHS,20,0,0,0,,忙来忙去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:06.03,CHS,21,0,0,0,,可否再请问
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:09.49,CHS,22,0,0,0,,先让船长参观一下好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:20.59,CHS,23,0,0,0,,船长  对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:26.72,CHS,24,0,0,0,,容我介绍企业B号的舵手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.39,0:04:29.56,CHS,25,0,0,0,,慕拉 苏慕拉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:34.52,CHS,26,0,0,0,,幸会  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:38.02,CHS,27,0,0,0,,家父曾谈及你的奇趣事迹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:41.15,CHS,28,0,0,0,,- 令尊是苏路?  - 正是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:44.32,CHS,29,0,0,0,,- 你见过她  当时  - 见过不久
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:47.07,CHS,30,0,0,0,,- 顶多是  - 12年前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:49.28,CHS,31,0,0,0,,- 12年前?  - 对极
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:51.87,CHS,32,0,0,0,,难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.16,0:04:53.70,CHS,33,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:56.96,CHS,34,0,0,0,,企业号理应由苏氏掌舵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:58.04,CHS,35,0,0,0,,谢谢过奖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.17,0:05:00.46,CHS,36,0,0,0,,令尊必以你为荣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:02.05,CHS,37,0,0,0,,但愿不负所望
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.38,0:05:07.22,CHS,38,0,0,0,,她比我当年年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:11.56,CHS,39,0,0,0,,你当年比她更年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:19.86,CHS,40,0,0,0,,- 一流的太空船  - 史葛  真出人意表
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:22.23,CHS,41,0,0,0,,什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.19,0:05:26.53,CHS,42,0,0,0,,苏路怎有时间成家立室?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.82,0:05:27.82,CHS,43,0,0,0,,如你所说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:30.20,CHS,44,0,0,0,,有要事  必腾出时间去办
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:34.08,CHS,45,0,0,0,,所以你似乎静极思动?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:36.50,CHS,46,0,0,0,,退休生活稍嫌寂寞?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:39.17,CHS,47,0,0,0,,你这工程师太率直
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:42.50,CHS,48,0,0,0,,当心理医生就糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:47.84,CHS,49,0,0,0,,可否请两位就坐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:51.35,CHS,50,0,0,0,,乐意之至
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.01,CHS,51,0,0,0,,准备启航  1/4前推力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.10,0:05:57.02,CHS,52,0,0,0,,左右舷定位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:58.85,CHS,53,0,0,0,,- 却克船长  - 什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:06:01.69,CHS,54,0,0,0,,可否请你下令启航
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:06.36,CHS,55,0,0,0,,- 多谢盛情  但  - 船长  请
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:09.28,CHS,56,0,0,0,,- 我不可以  - 我是诚意的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:20.25,CHS,57,0,0,0,,出发去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:31.22,CHS,58,0,0,0,,- 说得好  船长  - 赚人热泪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:32.64,CHS,59,0,0,0,,多嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:53.57,CHS,60,0,0,0,,先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:55.87,CHS,61,0,0,0,,你们既参观完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.99,0:06:57.75,CHS,62,0,0,0,,有何感想?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:00.16,CHS,63,0,0,0,,- 不错  - 挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.29,0:07:02.50,CHS,64,0,0,0,,- 好  - 女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:04.67,CHS,65,0,0,0,,本船刚飞越星云区
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:07.25,CHS,66,0,0,0,,今天会绕过冥王星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:10.59,CHS,67,0,0,0,,然后折返太空站  简短的一日游
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:13.64,CHS,68,0,0,0,,会不会试试翘速系统?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:17.89,CHS,69,0,0,0,,船长  有求救讯号
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:23.48,CHS,70,0,0,0,,开启扩音器
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:26.61,CHS,71,0,0,0,,这是运输船濑鸥号
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:29.44,CHS,72,0,0,0,,本船队现正遇上一个凌厉异能场
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:34.12,CHS,73,0,0,0,,已有两艘船被困
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:37.08,CHS,74,0,0,0,,不能脱困  急需救援
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:40.87,CHS,75,0,0,0,,船身随时被扯碎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:43.08,CHS,76,0,0,0,,濑鸥号正运载
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:44.92,CHS,77,0,0,0,,艾奥难民到地球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.55,CHS,78,0,0,0,,慕拉  他们在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:51.55,CHS,79,0,0,0,,该两船位置: 310测标215
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:07:54.01,CHS,80,0,0,0,,距离: 三光年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:00.56,CHS,81,0,0,0,,叫附近星船救援
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:03.39,CHS,82,0,0,0,,我们准备不足
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:10.61,CHS,83,0,0,0,,- 连船员也不齐全  - 附近只有我们这艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:21.87,CHS,84,0,0,0,,既然如此  只好靠我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:27.04,CHS,85,0,0,0,,舵手  对准目标  全翘速进发
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.21,0:08:28.71,CHS,86,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:39.31,CHS,87,0,0,0,,你的椅子不舒服吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:50.36,CHS,88,0,0,0,,船长  异能场在望
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:53.78,CHS,89,0,0,0,,荧幕显示
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:08:59.95,CHS,90,0,0,0,,怎么一回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:04.00,CHS,91,0,0,0,,我已找到运输船
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:08.79,CHS,92,0,0,0,,船身受力过大  开始扭曲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:11.46,CHS,93,0,0,0,,不能支持多久
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:17.80,CHS,94,0,0,0,,我们正遇到能量带
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.89,0:09:20.14,CHS,95,0,0,0,,凌厉吸扭力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:24.89,CHS,96,0,0,0,,保持距离  以免卷入
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:28.31,CHS,97,0,0,0,,- 拖拉光 拖拉光  - 没有拖拉光
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.65,0:09:30.61,CHS,98,0,0,0,,连拖拉光也没有?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:33.15,CHS,99,0,0,0,,星期二才安装
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:35.90,CHS,100,0,0,0,,慕拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:41.66,CHS,101,0,0,0,,发放子空间  覆盖两艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:43.45,CHS,102,0,0,0,,或有助脱险
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.66,CHS,103,0,0,0,,太多量子干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:50.08,CHS,104,0,0,0,,用翘速机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:52.00,CHS,105,0,0,0,,排放等离子  削弱引力 如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:55.05,CHS,106,0,0,0,,排放等离子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.18,CHS,107,0,0,0,,不收效  因为
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:10:01.85,CHS,108,0,0,0,,船长  船身正崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.94,0:10:12.44,CHS,109,0,0,0,,- 船上有多少人?  - 265人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:22.74,CHS,110,0,0,0,,濑鸥号船身完整率只剩下12%
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:35.38,CHS,111,0,0,0,,却克船长  有建议吗? 可否赐告?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:38.92,CHS,112,0,0,0,,先驶近
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:40.51,CHS,113,0,0,0,,用光束把船员传送过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:43.43,CHS,114,0,0,0,,我们会被吸扭力扯碎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:46.56,CHS,115,0,0,0,,身为船长  难免冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.77,0:10:48.56,CHS,116,0,0,0,,舵手  驶近
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:50.73,CHS,117,0,0,0,,其次  关掉相机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:10:59.99,CHS,118,0,0,0,,- 已进入范围  - 发光束把他们传送到医疗室
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:03.07,CHS,119,0,0,0,,- 是  船长  - 本船有多少医疗人员?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:06.74,CHS,120,0,0,0,,医疗人员?  星期二才上班
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:10.50,CHS,121,0,0,0,,你们已成护士  随我来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.58,0:11:14.34,CHS,122,0,0,0,,机房报告等离子的替续器不稳
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.42,0:11:17.05,CHS,123,0,0,0,,船长  我瞄不准那些船
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:20.26,CHS,124,0,0,0,,他们似乎在时空中波动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.34,0:11:21.43,CHS,125,0,0,0,,史葛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:25.68,CHS,126,0,0,0,,真古怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:29.89,CHS,127,0,0,0,,他们的生命讯息在我们的时空中进出
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:31.60,CHS,128,0,0,0,,进出到哪里去?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:35.61,CHS,129,0,0,0,,- 船身正崩溃  - 史葛  送他们来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:44.28,CHS,130,0,0,0,,传送完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:52.29,CHS,131,0,0,0,,150人中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:55.96,CHS,132,0,0,0,,47人获救
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.89,0:12:12.10,CHS,133,0,0,0,,- 报告上来  - 我们遭能量带
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:14.27,CHS,134,0,0,0,,的边缘缠着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.35,0:12:16.73,CHS,135,0,0,0,,全速后退
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:25.24,CHS,136,0,0,0,,不要怕  我们会帮助你们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.41,0:12:26.74,CHS,137,0,0,0,,我们会帮助你们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:29.54,CHS,138,0,0,0,,- 无须担心  - 我妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:31.50,CHS,139,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:34.92,CHS,140,0,0,0,,你已获救  在企业号上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:38.92,CHS,141,0,0,0,,- 不 我要回去  - 你必须留下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:41.05,CHS,142,0,0,0,,- 不 你不懂 - 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:43.76,CHS,143,0,0,0,,求你让我回去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:48.26,CHS,144,0,0,0,,让我回去 求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:53.93,CHS,145,0,0,0,,- 他在说什么?  - 天晓得
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:55.85,CHS,146,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.28,CHS,147,0,0,0,,我可帮你吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:09.74,CHS,148,0,0,0,,不要担心  你会没事  休息一下就行  这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:19.00,CHS,149,0,0,0,,这股吸扭力太大  不可能摆脱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:22.30,CHS,150,0,0,0,,- 船身完整率82%  - 我有个理论
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:23.88,CHS,151,0,0,0,,早料到你有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:26.88,CHS,152,0,0,0,,船头排放反物质
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:30.55,CHS,153,0,0,0,,干扰异能场  或可脱身
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:32.22,CHS,154,0,0,0,,- 光雷弹  - 是  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:33.39,CHS,155,0,0,0,,我们正失去动力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:35.64,CHS,156,0,0,0,,准备发射光雷弹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:40.56,CHS,157,0,0,0,,- 我们没有  - 又要等星期二安装?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:45.15,CHS,158,0,0,0,,- 船身完整率40%  - 有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:46.95,CHS,159,0,0,0,,用导向碟发出共振爆破
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.07,0:13:50.32,CHS,160,0,0,0,,与发射光雷弹效果一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:54.62,CHS,161,0,0,0,,- 导向碟的掣呢?  - 在15层  甲21区
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:57.16,CHS,162,0,0,0,,我去开掣  你指挥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:03.42,CHS,163,0,0,0,,且慢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.59,0:14:07.84,CHS,164,0,0,0,,指挥是你的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:11.18,CHS,165,0,0,0,,我去开掣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:17.81,CHS,166,0,0,0,,稳定这船  等我回来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.94,0:14:19.60,CHS,167,0,0,0,,我一向尽力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:28.88,CHS,168,0,0,0,,45秒后结构崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:31.38,CHS,169,0,0,0,,却克船长
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.84,0:15:33.93,CHS,170,0,0,0,,我是却克
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:37.26,CHS,171,0,0,0,,我不知船可支持多久
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.73,0:15:48.69,CHS,172,0,0,0,,行  发动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:50.94,CHS,173,0,0,0,,发动导向碟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.79,0:15:59.95,CHS,174,0,0,0,,我们开始脱险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:21.73,CHS,175,0,0,0,,不要紧  我在增添冲力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:25.94,CHS,176,0,0,0,,- 已经脱险  - 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:27.81,CHS,177,0,0,0,,损毁报告
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:30.44,CHS,178,0,0,0,,右舷机舱被扭曲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:32.99,CHS,179,0,0,0,,机房出现破裂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:35.45,CHS,180,0,0,0,,紧急力场已开启
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:36.99,CHS,181,0,0,0,,破裂范围呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:42.25,CHS,182,0,0,0,,由第20至28区  第13、14层
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:46.25,CHS,183,0,0,0,,还有第15层
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:53.26,CHS,184,0,0,0,,却克船长  这是驾驶室  请答话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:17:00.93,CHS,185,0,0,0,,叫查哥夫到15层找我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:31.71,CHS,186,0,0,0,,老天  破裂时  这里有人吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:36.22,CHS,187,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.95,0:18:47.79,CHS,188,0,0,0,,带上犯人来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:03.14,CHS,189,0,0,0,,胡夫  我早料有此一日
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:07.43,CHS,190,0,0,0,,- 准备好听控罪没有?  - 答话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.31,0:19:11.60,CHS,191,0,0,0,,准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.65,0:19:18.57,CHS,192,0,0,0,,我们是企业号的成员
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.65,0:19:20.74,CHS,193,0,0,0,,经慎重考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:24.41,CHS,194,0,0,0,,兹对胡上尉  提出如下控罪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.58,0:19:28.75,CHS,195,0,0,0,,其一  他故意屡次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:33.50,CHS,196,0,0,0,,有超乎尽忠职守的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:35.50,CHS,197,0,0,0,,其二  更严重的是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:40.51,CHS,198,0,0,0,,他赢得全体船员的爱戴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:45.18,CHS,199,0,0,0,,本人谨擢升你为少校
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.81,0:19:48.68,CHS,200,0,0,0,,授予你少校的一切权益
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:51.69,CHS,201,0,0,0,,愿上帝宽恕你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.69,0:19:58.94,CHS,202,0,0,0,,- 嗨 嗨 - 万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.03,0:20:00.24,CHS,203,0,0,0,,- 嗨 嗨 - 万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.32,0:20:01.61,CHS,204,0,0,0,,- 嗨 嗨 - 万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.03,0:20:04.49,CHS,205,0,0,0,,- 恭喜你  胡夫  - 谢谢  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:06.66,CHS,206,0,0,0,,伸出跳板
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.13,0:20:16.21,CHS,207,0,0,0,,垂下军帽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:20.84,CHS,208,0,0,0,,- 小心  - 你去拿那个帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:23.80,CHS,209,0,0,0,,从没有人办得到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.81,0:20:31.18,CHS,210,0,0,0,,跳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:49.24,CHS,211,0,0,0,,是  胡夫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:51.66,CHS,212,0,0,0,,据经验  克林冈人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:54.00,CHS,213,0,0,0,,决不可小觑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:21:00.71,CHS,214,0,0,0,,电脑  取掉跳板
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:04.59,CHS,215,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:16.52,CHS,216,0,0,0,,大副  是收回  不是取掉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:18.10,CHS,217,0,0,0,,是  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:21.94,CHS,218,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.37,0:21:32.87,CHS,219,0,0,0,,医生  我不很明白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:36.41,CHS,220,0,0,0,,为什么掉进冰冷的水中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:38.46,CHS,221,0,0,0,,是件好笑的事?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:40.21,CHS,222,0,0,0,,- 耍乐而已  数据  - 耍乐?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.30,0:21:43.30,CHS,223,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:46.13,CHS,224,0,0,0,,你得感染气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:49.30,CHS,225,0,0,0,,自然而然  尽情投入
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:52.64,CHS,226,0,0,0,,- 出其不意  明白吗?  - 明白
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:19.12,CHS,227,0,0,0,,- 数据  - 那是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.25,0:22:20.75,CHS,228,0,0,0,,不好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.25,0:22:26.92,CHS,229,0,0,0,,船员们  各就各位  准备起航
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.43,0:22:29.59,CHS,230,0,0,0,,- 准备转帆索  - 威廉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.27,0:22:39.48,CHS,231,0,0,0,,遥想古时的光景  没有引擎  电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.60,0:22:44.44,CHS,232,0,0,0,,只有海  风  导航的星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.53,0:22:47.61,CHS,233,0,0,0,,难吃的食物  纪律严苛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:49.90,CHS,234,0,0,0,,没有女人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.99,0:22:52.53,CHS,235,0,0,0,,- 皮船长  - 我是皮尚鲁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.03,0:22:56.12,CHS,236,0,0,0,,地球传来你私人电讯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.45,0:22:58.29,CHS,237,0,0,0,,送到这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.37,0:23:01.83,CHS,238,0,0,0,,海上生活最好之处是不受骚扰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:05.38,CHS,239,0,0,0,,可以自由自在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:08.97,CHS,240,0,0,0,,电脑  拱门
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.35,0:23:15.06,CHS,241,0,0,0,,干活去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.90,0:23:30.82,CHS,242,0,0,0,,你掌舵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.88,0:23:55.76,CHS,243,0,0,0,,船长  你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.26,0:24:01.39,CHS,244,0,0,0,,我没事  失陪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:05.44,CHS,245,0,0,0,,电脑  出路
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.28,0:24:16.78,CHS,246,0,0,0,,- 佐迪 挂顶帆  翼帆  - 中校  翼帆在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.54,0:24:19.83,CHS,247,0,0,0,,在那桅横杆上面的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.91,0:24:22.62,CHS,248,0,0,0,,- 拟真3号答话  - 我是韦威廉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.71,0:24:25.75,CHS,249,0,0,0,,亚马观察站发出求救讯号
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.88,0:24:28.04,CHS,250,0,0,0,,说受到袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.55,0:24:32.26,CHS,251,0,0,0,,各人速回作战岗位  皮船长到驾驶室
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.44,0:24:49.40,CHS,252,0,0,0,,- 似乎为时已晚  - 这星系内没有其他船只
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.82,0:24:52.57,CHS,253,0,0,0,,亚马站就在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.90,0:24:55.45,CHS,254,0,0,0,,看来损毁□重
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.57,0:24:56.74,CHS,255,0,0,0,,生还者呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.82,0:24:59.45,CHS,256,0,0,0,,据感应器所示  有五名
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.58,0:25:01.83,CHS,257,0,0,0,,该站本来有19人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.67,0:25:06.67,CHS,258,0,0,0,,解除戒备
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.25,0:25:11.17,CHS,259,0,0,0,,大副
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.93,0:25:17.68,CHS,260,0,0,0,,立即调查  我在候命室
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.76,0:25:20.60,CHS,261,0,0,0,,- 船长  我以为  - 照吩咐
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.47,0:25:24.60,CHS,262,0,0,0,,- 胡先生  - 是  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.16,0:25:43.12,CHS,263,0,0,0,,胡先生  跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.54,0:25:46.71,CHS,264,0,0,0,,袭击所用的武器  是第三类
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.79,0:25:51.21,CHS,265,0,0,0,,属于罗武伦 布连  克林冈等人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.55,0:26:36.17,CHS,266,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.51,0:26:41.89,CHS,267,0,0,0,,别怕  别挣扎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.10,0:26:53.73,CHS,268,0,0,0,,我们就在这里  抓到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.78,0:27:05.03,CHS,269,0,0,0,,我是企业号的韦威廉中校
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.79,0:27:10.54,CHS,270,0,0,0,,我是苏伦 苏伦博士
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.46,0:27:17.30,CHS,271,0,0,0,,- 谁袭击你们?  - 知道  突如其来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.76,0:27:20.97,CHS,272,0,0,0,,中校 请你来看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.74,0:27:43.07,CHS,273,0,0,0,,罗武伦人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.28,0:27:49.75,CHS,274,0,0,0,,数据  你究竟为什么推她下水
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:53.79,CHS,275,0,0,0,,我只想感染一下气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.63,0:27:57.50,CHS,276,0,0,0,,以为会好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.01,0:28:00.51,CHS,277,0,0,0,,她仍在生气?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.59,0:28:04.34,CHS,278,0,0,0,,你最好远离医疗室一两日
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.48,0:28:20.57,CHS,279,0,0,0,,数据  你真想装上情绪晶片?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.65,0:28:23.28,CHS,280,0,0,0,,我已考虑多月
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.61,0:28:26.87,CHS,281,0,0,0,,加上最近与赫医生的误会
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.28,0:28:29.58,CHS,282,0,0,0,,还是现在装上较好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.66,0:28:32.83,CHS,283,0,0,0,,不怕神经网络负荷过重?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.50,0:28:35.21,CHS,284,0,0,0,,有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.50,0:28:40.17,CHS,285,0,0,0,,但作为人造生物
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.30,0:28:42.30,CHS,286,0,0,0,,我已不能更进一步成长
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.38,0:28:46.84,CHS,287,0,0,0,,34年来  我想更有人性
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.47,0:28:50.18,CHS,288,0,0,0,,超越原来的程式
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.48,0:28:56.19,CHS,289,0,0,0,,但仍掌握不到基本概念 诸如幽默
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.15,0:29:01.86,CHS,290,0,0,0,,这情绪晶片可能是唯一办法
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.04,0:29:17.21,CHS,291,0,0,0,,佐迪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.38,0:29:21.71,CHS,292,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.19,0:29:41.23,CHS,293,0,0,0,,但稍有异状  我就关掉这晶片  同意吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.69,0:29:44.19,CHS,294,0,0,0,,同意
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.70,0:29:52.12,CHS,295,0,0,0,,发现两名罗武伦死者
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.74,0:29:54.58,CHS,296,0,0,0,,正分析他们的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.71,0:29:56.29,CHS,297,0,0,0,,追查来源
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.54,0:30:00.71,CHS,298,0,0,0,,袭击动机未明
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.09,0:30:05.38,CHS,299,0,0,0,,他们把该站大肆捣毁  而且接通电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.72,0:30:07.09,CHS,300,0,0,0,,彻底搜索货仓
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.22,0:30:09.80,CHS,301,0,0,0,,分明在寻找某些物件
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.10,0:30:13.89,CHS,302,0,0,0,,罗武伦人可能有意入侵本区
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.23,0:30:21.73,CHS,303,0,0,0,,- 通知总部  - 你要我通知总部?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.23,0:30:23.90,CHS,304,0,0,0,,- 有问题吗?  - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:28.74,CHS,305,0,0,0,,还有一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.95,0:30:32.74,CHS,306,0,0,0,,科学家苏伦  一定要跟你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.24,0:30:34.58,CHS,307,0,0,0,,我说你很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.66,0:30:38.08,CHS,308,0,0,0,,他说事态极紧急
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.17,0:30:40.12,CHS,309,0,0,0,,我明白  行了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.47,0:30:52.09,CHS,310,0,0,0,,- 船长  有没有  - 没有  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.82,0:31:13.78,CHS,311,0,0,0,,两位  科加士3号有新货到
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.33,0:31:22.46,CHS,312,0,0,0,,什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.54,0:31:26.46,CHS,313,0,0,0,,这饮料令我产生情绪反应
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.63,0:31:28.55,CHS,314,0,0,0,,是吗? 什么的反应?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.13,0:31:32.68,CHS,315,0,0,0,,难以确定
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.05,0:31:34.80,CHS,316,0,0,0,,因为缺少情绪经验  我难以
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.89,0:31:37.97,CHS,317,0,0,0,,形容这感受
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.31,0:31:43.06,CHS,318,0,0,0,,- 情绪?  - 我稍后才解释
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.19,0:31:51.65,CHS,319,0,0,0,,- 他似乎厌恶那味道  - 对了  说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.03,0:31:56.83,CHS,320,0,0,0,,- 我厌恶这味道  - 数据  晶片生效
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.21,0:32:04.96,CHS,321,0,0,0,,这味道糟透  令我反胃
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.04,0:32:07.00,CHS,322,0,0,0,,- 还有什么?  - 请讲
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.18,0:32:18.89,CHS,323,0,0,0,,观察站的苏伦博士在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.28,0:32:29.78,CHS,324,0,0,0,,- 苏伦博士?  - 是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.19,0:32:32.36,CHS,325,0,0,0,,船长  谢谢你来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.45,0:32:35.16,CHS,326,0,0,0,,据说你有要事找我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.24,0:32:38.62,CHS,327,0,0,0,,对  我必须立即回观察站
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.79,0:32:42.75,CHS,328,0,0,0,,继续做对亚马星的关键研究
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.87,0:32:45.21,CHS,329,0,0,0,,袭击事件仍在调查中
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.29,0:32:46.92,CHS,330,0,0,0,,- 可是我  - 直到调查完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.04,0:32:48.67,CHS,331,0,0,0,,你们才能回去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.75,0:32:50.42,CHS,332,0,0,0,,目前不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.55,0:32:54.30,CHS,333,0,0,0,,我的实验必须配合时间
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.14,0:33:00.14,CHS,334,0,0,0,,12小时内若不完成  多年心血将白费
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.22,0:33:03.43,CHS,335,0,0,0,,我们会尽力  失陪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.56,0:33:10.15,CHS,336,0,0,0,,据说时间是活力的泉源
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.65,0:33:17.24,CHS,337,0,0,0,,船长  现在我的时间无多
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.62,0:33:23.41,CHS,338,0,0,0,,我们一生有太多未了之事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.17,0:33:27.25,CHS,339,0,0,0,,相信你了解
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.59,0:33:32.59,CHS,340,0,0,0,,我尽力而为
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.38,0:34:18.18,CHS,341,0,0,0,,据线索  罗武伦人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.30,0:34:20.18,CHS,342,0,0,0,,正搜索一种
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.30,0:34:23.56,CHS,343,0,0,0,,- 叫三锂的化合物  - 三锂?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.64,0:34:26.73,CHS,344,0,0,0,,罗武伦人正研制中
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.81,0:34:29.02,CHS,345,0,0,0,,能抑制核子活动
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.31,0:34:32.40,CHS,346,0,0,0,,理论上  能抑制星球的核聚变
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.48,0:34:35.69,CHS,347,0,0,0,,但抑制过程仍未稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.82,0:34:37.57,CHS,348,0,0,0,,怎会找到联邦观察站上去?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.65,0:34:39.20,CHS,349,0,0,0,,这不合理
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.99,0:34:41.57,CHS,350,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.66,0:34:43.91,CHS,351,0,0,0,,下次派佐迪  数据跟特遣队
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.99,0:34:45.62,CHS,352,0,0,0,,到观察站  探测三锂
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.70,0:34:47.25,CHS,353,0,0,0,,是  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.54,0:34:56.17,CHS,354,0,0,0,,这里毫无三锂的迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.72,0:35:08.43,CHS,355,0,0,0,,- 我明白了  我明白了  - 明白什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.19,0:35:13.81,CHS,356,0,0,0,,当时你对韦中校说  "那小丑可留下"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.90,0:35:17.07,CHS,357,0,0,0,,"但那披上猩猩皮 的藩奇人必须滚"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.20,0:35:19.61,CHS,358,0,0,0,,你在说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.70,0:35:21.74,CHS,359,0,0,0,,我们去远点时
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.87,0:35:26.29,CHS,360,0,0,0,,你在驾驶室  说了个笑话  那是惹笑的一句
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.29,0:35:30.37,CHS,361,0,0,0,,远点 七年前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.46,0:35:33.04,CHS,362,0,0,0,,我知道  刚弄明白
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.54,0:35:35.92,CHS,363,0,0,0,,的确好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.15,0:35:59.32,CHS,364,0,0,0,,等一等  你背后有道暗门
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.82,0:36:01.90,CHS,365,0,0,0,,我凭视器见到门缝
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.16,0:36:04.66,CHS,366,0,0,0,,似乎有一幅减力场
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.74,0:36:07.33,CHS,367,0,0,0,,令我看不到舱壁后面
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.83,0:36:11.79,CHS,368,0,0,0,,没有控制板  通道之类
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.12,0:36:15.08,CHS,369,0,0,0,,似乎是磁密封
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.09,0:36:20.51,CHS,370,0,0,0,,我可调低轴向伺服机掉转磁极
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.01,0:36:29.27,CHS,371,0,0,0,,芝麻开门
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.81,0:36:39.82,CHS,372,0,0,0,,我可算充满磁般的吸引力
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.99,0:36:44.32,CHS,373,0,0,0,,幽默  甚合我意
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.55,0:37:07.85,CHS,374,0,0,0,,数据  过来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.39,0:37:14.98,CHS,375,0,0,0,,见过这模样的探日仪吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.15,0:37:19.02,CHS,376,0,0,0,,佐迪  我没有见过  你呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.40,0:37:22.40,CHS,377,0,0,0,,我没有  这仪器很不寻常
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.90,0:37:25.91,CHS,378,0,0,0,,三码器先生
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.53,0:37:30.49,CHS,379,0,0,0,,帮我打开嵌板好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.83,0:37:32.41,CHS,380,0,0,0,,打开嵌板
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.25,0:37:43.05,CHS,381,0,0,0,,我的视器有所发现
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.17,0:37:45.42,CHS,382,0,0,0,,可能是三钾制的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.93,0:37:51.51,CHS,383,0,0,0,,- 数据  正经点  - 我不由自主
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.93,0:37:54.68,CHS,384,0,0,0,,相信我有毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.52,0:38:02.94,CHS,385,0,0,0,,数据
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.95,0:38:14.24,CHS,386,0,0,0,,数据  你觉得怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.08,0:38:23.38,CHS,387,0,0,0,,情绪晶片使我正子掣负荷过重
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.46,0:38:26.72,CHS,388,0,0,0,,还是送你回船
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.55,0:38:34.14,CHS,389,0,0,0,,- 企业号  这是佐迪  - 两位  有问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.89,0:38:36.39,CHS,390,0,0,0,,苏伦博士
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.64,0:38:39.98,CHS,391,0,0,0,,这里似乎有幅减力场
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.06,0:38:42.98,CHS,392,0,0,0,,阻挡通讯  可关闭吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.15,0:38:46.28,CHS,393,0,0,0,,当然可以  我万分乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.29,0:39:00.00,CHS,394,0,0,0,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.25,0:39:05.75,CHS,395,0,0,0,,不要伤害我  求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.19,0:39:28.86,CHS,396,0,0,0,,进来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.86,0:39:33.95,CHS,397,0,0,0,,顾问  可以帮你吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.95,0:39:34.95,CHS,398,0,0,0,,事实上  我想帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.46,0:39:40.37,CHS,399,0,0,0,,我的家事而已
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.46,0:39:46.63,CHS,400,0,0,0,,你没见过舍弟夫妇吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.46,0:39:49.72,CHS,401,0,0,0,,- 没见过  - 舍弟叫罗拔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.39,0:39:57.47,CHS,402,0,0,0,,固执自我  不可一世
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.39,0:40:00.39,CHS,403,0,0,0,,凡事独断独行
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.48,0:40:05.31,CHS,404,0,0,0,,近几年来  他略为收敛
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.07,0:40:11.24,CHS,405,0,0,0,,下月  我本打算回地球探访他
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.32,0:40:13.66,CHS,406,0,0,0,,一同去三藩市
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.74,0:40:16.53,CHS,407,0,0,0,,连尼渴望参观星舰学院
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.70,0:40:19.41,CHS,408,0,0,0,,连尼? 是令侄
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.50,0:40:23.25,CHS,409,0,0,0,,他与其父性格截然不同
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.00,0:40:28.67,CHS,410,0,0,0,,他是一个梦想家 且爱幻想
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.26,0:40:35.01,CHS,411,0,0,0,,他温柔敦厚
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.68,0:40:43.77,CHS,412,0,0,0,,出了什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.02,0:40:48.02,CHS,413,0,0,0,,罗拔和连尼父子俩
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.69,0:40:53.53,CHS,414,0,0,0,,在火灾中被烧死
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.20,0:40:58.78,CHS,415,0,0,0,,- 我很难过  - 不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.58,0:41:01.16,CHS,416,0,0,0,,天灾人祸
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.25,0:41:05.37,CHS,417,0,0,0,,船长 这并非不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.13,0:41:08.75,CHS,418,0,0,0,,我不期然地想着
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.55,0:41:14.05,CHS,419,0,0,0,,连尼失去了许多人生经验
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.30,0:41:18.97,CHS,420,0,0,0,,参观学院和阅读  欣赏音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.72,0:41:21.72,CHS,421,0,0,0,,恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.39,0:41:25.98,CHS,422,0,0,0,,人生奋斗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.15,0:41:33.74,CHS,423,0,0,0,,如今一切都化为泡影
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.82,0:41:40.58,CHS,424,0,0,0,,想不到他对你那么重要
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.91,0:41:45.04,CHS,425,0,0,0,,我没有子嗣  连尼如同
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.12,0:41:47.25,CHS,426,0,0,0,,我的亲生骨肉
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.68,0:42:03.64,CHS,427,0,0,0,,你重视家族  对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.77,0:42:04.85,CHS,428,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.02,0:42:13.03,CHS,429,0,0,0,,我自幼从家长口中
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.32,0:42:16.45,CHS,430,0,0,0,,得悉家族史  列代先人中
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.65,0:42:19.11,CHS,431,0,0,0,,有参加特拉法加战役的人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.49,0:42:22.53,CHS,432,0,0,0,,有诺贝尔化学得奖者
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.04,0:42:26.37,CHS,433,0,0,0,,也有开拓火星的首批殖民
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.29,0:42:34.50,CHS,434,0,0,0,,当罗拔娶妻生子  我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.01,0:42:39.34,CHS,435,0,0,0,,觉得自己无须负责
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.47,0:42:41.55,CHS,436,0,0,0,,继后香灯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.06,0:42:46.68,CHS,437,0,0,0,,说得对极
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.36,0:42:54.98,CHS,438,0,0,0,,顾问  最近我清楚察觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.07,0:42:58.65,CHS,439,0,0,0,,我的人生过了一大半
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.74,0:43:04.83,CHS,440,0,0,0,,令我安慰的是家族的香火不断
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.67,0:43:12.17,CHS,441,0,0,0,,但现在  皮氏已绝后
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.68,0:43:27.77,CHS,442,0,0,0,,报告上来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.85,0:43:30.52,CHS,443,0,0,0,,亚马星发生量子内炸
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.60,0:43:35.90,CHS,444,0,0,0,,- 一切核聚变都瓦解  - 怎可能?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.03,0:43:37.82,CHS,445,0,0,0,,观察站刚发射
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.90,0:43:40.57,CHS,446,0,0,0,,探日仪到太阳去
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.70,0:43:42.95,CHS,447,0,0,0,,数分钟后  亚马星将崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.03,0:43:46.95,CHS,448,0,0,0,,量子内炸威力达12度震波
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.04,0:43:49.08,CHS,449,0,0,0,,即将彻底摧毁本星系
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.21,0:43:50.54,CHS,450,0,0,0,,传送室报告
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.62,0:43:53.54,CHS,451,0,0,0,,林中尉  数据失踪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.63,0:43:57.63,CHS,452,0,0,0,,- 他们没有回船?  - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.92,0:44:00.80,CHS,453,0,0,0,,震波几时抵达观察站?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.88,0:44:02.63,CHS,454,0,0,0,,4分40秒
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.80,0:44:03.97,CHS,455,0,0,0,,大副
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.05,0:44:06.05,CHS,456,0,0,0,,- 胡先生  - 是  中校
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.74,0:44:21.15,CHS,457,0,0,0,,苏伦  报上你的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.42,0:44:38.30,CHS,458,0,0,0,,他在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.42,0:44:42.38,CHS,459,0,0,0,,韦中校  你们只剩两分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.47,0:44:44.26,CHS,460,0,0,0,,听见吗? 苏伦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.76,0:44:48.51,CHS,461,0,0,0,,12度震波来袭  我们非走不可
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.68,0:44:55.65,CHS,462,0,0,0,,一艘克林冈猛禽在左船头现形
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.27,0:44:58.61,CHS,463,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.37,0:45:18.54,CHS,464,0,0,0,,- 你设法接近佐迪  - 我办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.46,0:45:22.38,CHS,465,0,0,0,,准备传送
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.52,0:45:42.07,CHS,466,0,0,0,,- 韦中校等人已回  - 翘速1  发动
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.92,0:45:57.83,CHS,467,0,0,0,,你成功了  苏伦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.34,0:46:06.55,CHS,468,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.94,0:46:26.95,CHS,469,0,0,0,,为你着想  就当你在向我求欢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.57,0:46:29.36,CHS,470,0,0,0,,你太粗心大意
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.45,0:46:32.70,CHS,471,0,0,0,,罗武伦人来寻找三锂
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.79,0:46:38.08,CHS,472,0,0,0,,怎么会? 我们没留活口
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.21,0:46:42.79,CHS,473,0,0,0,,他们知道观察站有三锂  若非企业号插手
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.88,0:46:44.55,CHS,474,0,0,0,,他们已找到
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.63,0:46:49.63,CHS,475,0,0,0,,但他们没找到  现在犀利武器在我们处
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.14,0:46:55.97,CHS,476,0,0,0,,不  雷莎  武器在我处
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.06,0:47:00.23,CHS,477,0,0,0,,想我交出来的话  你们以后可得小心谨慎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.90,0:47:03.44,CHS,478,0,0,0,,我们或许对你不耐烦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.15,0:47:09.11,CHS,479,0,0,0,,没有我的研究  三锂没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.99,0:47:14.78,CHS,480,0,0,0,,你们收复克林冈的大计也告吹
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.17,0:47:25.92,CHS,481,0,0,0,,朝维星系进发  全翘速
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.01,0:47:35.43,CHS,482,0,0,0,,苏伦是艾奥星人  年龄300岁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.93,0:47:39.27,CHS,483,0,0,0,,波格人毁灭他的星球时
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.44,0:47:41.81,CHS,484,0,0,0,,只有他与少数人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.27,0:47:44.44,CHS,485,0,0,0,,乘濑鸥号逃出生天
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.52,0:47:48.28,CHS,486,0,0,0,,其后  该船被某能量带摧毁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.36,0:47:52.61,CHS,487,0,0,0,,但苏伦与46人获企业B号救起
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.70,0:47:54.74,CHS,488,0,0,0,,在那任务中  却克殉职
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.83,0:47:57.37,CHS,489,0,0,0,,我查过濑鸥号乘客名单
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.00,0:48:00.12,CHS,490,0,0,0,,猜还有谁在船上?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.04,0:48:06.92,CHS,491,0,0,0,,我很久没听过苏伦这个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.00,0:48:09.55,CHS,492,0,0,0,,- 记得他?  - 记得
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.68,0:48:16.39,CHS,493,0,0,0,,关于他的一切  你必须告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.97,0:48:22.39,CHS,494,0,0,0,,苏伦或已研制一种武器  极犀利的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.02,0:48:25.69,CHS,495,0,0,0,,令他有足够威力毁灭
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.82,0:48:28.82,CHS,496,0,0,0,,苏伦才不管武器或威力
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.65,0:48:32.61,CHS,497,0,0,0,,只管如何重回时汇
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.70,0:48:34.32,CHS,498,0,0,0,,时汇是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.24,0:48:38.70,CHS,499,0,0,0,,摧毁胾鸥的能量带
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.25,0:48:43.04,CHS,500,0,0,0,,这并非宇宙偶然现象 而是某种门户
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.17,0:48:47.50,CHS,501,0,0,0,,这门户通往一个叫时汇的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.59,0:48:51.17,CHS,502,0,0,0,,处身时汇的感觉  我难以忘怀
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.76,0:49:00.43,CHS,503,0,0,0,,你那时怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.02,0:49:08.02,CHS,504,0,0,0,,我觉得浸淫在喜悦中
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.61,0:49:11.32,CHS,505,0,0,0,,喜悦仿佛像件实物
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.40,0:49:14.70,CHS,506,0,0,0,,可以像毛毯般裹在身上
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.12,0:49:20.79,CHS,507,0,0,0,,我一辈子  从未试过那样满足
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.46,0:49:24.29,CHS,508,0,0,0,,跟着你被传送走
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.37,0:49:27.63,CHS,509,0,0,0,,被拖走 被扯走
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.71,0:49:30.55,CHS,510,0,0,0,,我们都不想走
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.38,0:49:35.26,CHS,511,0,0,0,,为了回去  我什么也愿干
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.26,0:49:41.18,CHS,512,0,0,0,,明白了不可回去后
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.27,0:49:43.06,CHS,513,0,0,0,,我只好认命
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.14,0:49:44.39,CHS,514,0,0,0,,苏伦呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.48,0:49:48.15,CHS,515,0,0,0,,他要回去的话  会不择手段
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.65,0:49:52.94,CHS,516,0,0,0,,他摧毁星球  有何目的?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.62,0:50:00.49,CHS,517,0,0,0,,谢谢你  姬兰
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.91,0:50:05.91,CHS,518,0,0,0,,你要去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.33,0:50:10.42,CHS,519,0,0,0,,会不顾一切
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.75,0:50:15.26,CHS,520,0,0,0,,不顾这船  苏伦 我  任何东西
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.26,0:50:19.59,CHS,521,0,0,0,,只想留在时汇内
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.35,0:50:24.02,CHS,522,0,0,0,,不想回来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.12,0:50:41.83,CHS,523,0,0,0,,了不起的科技
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.79,0:50:46.12,CHS,524,0,0,0,,好一个先进的器材
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.29,0:50:51.96,CHS,525,0,0,0,,- 很高兴你赏识  - 可惜不美观  对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.13,0:51:00.30,CHS,526,0,0,0,,有没有考虑过整容  令自己外表更加
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.97,0:51:04.14,CHS,527,0,0,0,,应怎说呢 更加正常?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.47,0:51:07.48,CHS,528,0,0,0,,- 什么是正常?  - 什么是正常?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.81,0:51:10.15,CHS,529,0,0,0,,问得好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.98,0:51:14.82,CHS,530,0,0,0,,正如常人的模样  而你不是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.15,0:51:22.20,CHS,531,0,0,0,,有话请你直说  你想怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.70,0:51:27.75,CHS,532,0,0,0,,不知你察觉到吗? 我是艾奥人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.87,0:51:31.83,CHS,533,0,0,0,,我们这种族  以聆听见称
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.59,0:51:38.26,CHS,534,0,0,0,,林先生  现在我全神贯注
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.72,0:51:43.18,CHS,535,0,0,0,,聆听你所知关于三锂的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.60,0:51:52.65,CHS,536,0,0,0,,船长日志  星历48632.4
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.73,0:51:55.82,CHS,537,0,0,0,,赫医生说  数据的情绪晶片
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.90,0:51:57.44,CHS,538,0,0,0,,已融入神经网络  不可切除
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.53,0:51:59.36,CHS,539,0,0,0,,但不影响工作能力
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.45,0:52:02.78,CHS,540,0,0,0,,于是我邀他到天象室来
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.70,0:52:08.04,CHS,541,0,0,0,,据我们的资料  该能量带由时间能量组成
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.12,0:52:11.87,CHS,542,0,0,0,,每39.1年路过本星系
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.54,0:52:16.21,CHS,543,0,0,0,,约42小时后  将途经本区
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.38,0:52:18.30,CHS,544,0,0,0,,姬兰说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.38,0:52:20.72,CHS,545,0,0,0,,苏伦想回能量带去
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.80,0:52:22.47,CHS,546,0,0,0,,果真如此
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.55,0:52:25.72,CHS,547,0,0,0,,亚马星必有所关连
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.81,0:52:29.39,CHS,548,0,0,0,,详列该星毁灭所引起的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.48,0:52:31.10,CHS,549,0,0,0,,我要钜细无遗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.44,0:52:35.06,CHS,550,0,0,0,,- 数据?  - 对不起  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.73,0:52:42.40,CHS,551,0,0,0,,电脑稍需时间整理资料
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.99,0:52:49.74,CHS,552,0,0,0,,数据  你觉得怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.79,0:52:57.34,CHS,553,0,0,0,,我难以专心
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.75,0:53:04.09,CHS,554,0,0,0,,对自己在观察站上的行为
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.43,0:53:08.35,CHS,555,0,0,0,,深感内疚  懊悔
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.60,0:53:09.93,CHS,556,0,0,0,,你的意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.64,0:53:13.27,CHS,557,0,0,0,,我想救助佐迪
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.77,0:53:17.98,CHS,558,0,0,0,,但当时令我意外的是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.82,0:53:22.19,CHS,559,0,0,0,,我感觉恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.49,0:53:25.11,CHS,560,0,0,0,,害怕起来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.29,0:53:32.75,CHS,561,0,0,0,,据最新资料
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.83,0:53:35.58,CHS,562,0,0,0,,亚马星灭亡  对本区影响如下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.67,0:53:39.79,CHS,563,0,0,0,,伽马射量增加0.05%
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.00,0:53:43.80,CHS,564,0,0,0,,布士文号太空船被迫改航
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.97,0:53:45.26,CHS,565,0,0,0,,四周的磁场
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.34,0:53:49.30,CHS,566,0,0,0,,布士文号为什么改航?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.47,0:53:51.10,CHS,567,0,0,0,,亚马星灭亡
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.18,0:53:54.43,CHS,568,0,0,0,,改变本区的引力
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.52,0:53:56.73,CHS,569,0,0,0,,任何太空船  途经本区
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.81,0:53:59.36,CHS,570,0,0,0,,都须稍改航道
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.48,0:54:03.48,CHS,571,0,0,0,,稍改航道  能量带目前在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.50,0:54:17.33,CHS,572,0,0,0,,- 目前在这里  - 可预测其途径吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.55,0:54:24.01,CHS,573,0,0,0,,船长
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.18,0:54:32.64,CHS,574,0,0,0,,我不能调查下去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.72,0:54:35.64,CHS,575,0,0,0,,割掉情绪晶片前 我想停止操作
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.73,0:54:37.64,CHS,576,0,0,0,,你发生故障?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.73,0:54:42.44,CHS,577,0,0,0,,不  我只是无法 控制自己的情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.36,0:54:46.53,CHS,578,0,0,0,,你的感受  我很同情
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.03,0:54:48.78,CHS,579,0,0,0,,但现在我需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.86,0:54:51.70,CHS,580,0,0,0,,我再不想要这些感情
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.03,0:54:55.37,CHS,581,0,0,0,,唯一的办法是关闭我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.45,0:55:00.38,CHS,582,0,0,0,,既有感情就应把感情融入生活
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.58,0:55:01.88,CHS,583,0,0,0,,学习适应感情
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.04,0:55:03.71,CHS,584,0,0,0,,- 而不管环境如何  - 我办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.80,0:55:05.76,CHS,585,0,0,0,,不准关闭
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.38,0:55:07.80,CHS,586,0,0,0,,你身为本船官员
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.88,0:55:11.97,CHS,587,0,0,0,,我要你尽责  这是项命令
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.05,0:55:13.30,CHS,588,0,0,0,,是  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.23,0:55:18.89,CHS,589,0,0,0,,我会尝试
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.32,0:55:26.40,CHS,590,0,0,0,,尝试有时需要勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.40,0:55:29.90,CHS,591,0,0,0,,勇气也是一种感情
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.95,0:55:33.91,CHS,592,0,0,0,,能预测能量带的途径吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.66,0:55:36.24,CHS,593,0,0,0,,相信可以
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.17,0:55:42.92,CHS,594,0,0,0,,放大9A格
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.26,0:55:48.67,CHS,595,0,0,0,,亚马星原本在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.30,0:55:54.72,CHS,596,0,0,0,,你说过  亚马星的灭亡
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.81,0:55:57.06,CHS,597,0,0,0,,影响本区的引力
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.14,0:55:59.31,CHS,598,0,0,0,,而这点在电脑预测途径时
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.48,0:56:01.27,CHS,599,0,0,0,,有没有考虑?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.35,0:56:04.31,CHS,600,0,0,0,,没有  我会调整
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.78,0:56:11.45,CHS,601,0,0,0,,苏伦在改变能量带的途径
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.28,0:56:17.29,CHS,602,0,0,0,,但为什么改变途径?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.95,0:56:20.46,CHS,603,0,0,0,,为什么不乘船直接飞去?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.62,0:56:23.08,CHS,604,0,0,0,,船只一接近
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.17,0:56:26.50,CHS,605,0,0,0,,不是被摧毁  就受重创
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.13,0:56:33.13,CHS,606,0,0,0,,他不能去  于是把能量带引来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.34,0:56:37.68,CHS,607,0,0,0,,数据  能量带经过M级星球吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.22,0:56:41.64,CHS,608,0,0,0,,经过  在维星系经过两个
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.39,0:56:46.52,CHS,609,0,0,0,,也经过维星3号  但不太接近
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.02,0:56:51.65,CHS,610,0,0,0,,若他消灭一颗维星
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.82,0:56:54.91,CHS,611,0,0,0,,能量带会怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.83,0:57:01.50,CHS,612,0,0,0,,苏伦正前往维星系
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.66,0:57:04.50,CHS,613,0,0,0,,这一点应当注意
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.88,0:57:07.84,CHS,614,0,0,0,,维星若崩溃  会像亚马星般
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.00,0:57:10.67,CHS,615,0,0,0,,产生类似的震波
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.92,0:57:13.59,CHS,616,0,0,0,,摧毁系内的所有星球
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.22,0:57:18.51,CHS,617,0,0,0,,维星3号没人住
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.68,0:57:23.85,CHS,618,0,0,0,,维星4号住着原始的类人动物
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.06,0:57:25.60,CHS,619,0,0,0,,人口有多少?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.90,0:57:30.57,CHS,620,0,0,0,,二亿三千万
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.36,0:57:35.11,CHS,621,0,0,0,,- 驾驶室听命  - 船长
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.20,0:57:38.20,CHS,622,0,0,0,,朝维星系进发  全翘速飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.23,0:58:07.23,CHS,623,0,0,0,,从那人类套到情报吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.31,0:58:10.65,CHS,624,0,0,0,,没有  他根本心不在焉
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.23,0:58:15.24,CHS,625,0,0,0,,已进维星3号的范围
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.57,0:58:24.08,CHS,626,0,0,0,,- 准备送我到地面  - 且慢  几时付我们酬劳?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.42,0:58:37.09,CHS,627,0,0,0,,这晶片记录三锂武器一切资料
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.09,0:58:40.93,CHS,628,0,0,0,,用密码记录
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.18,0:58:43.72,CHS,629,0,0,0,,我安全着陆后
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.81,0:58:46.89,CHS,630,0,0,0,,就会传送解码程序
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.98,0:58:49.52,CHS,631,0,0,0,,- 我着陆后才传送  - 主人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.61,0:58:51.69,CHS,632,0,0,0,,一艘联邦船正驶来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.77,0:58:54.11,CHS,633,0,0,0,,荧幕显示
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.65,0:58:56.82,CHS,634,0,0,0,,他们向我们呼唤
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.99,0:59:00.16,CHS,635,0,0,0,,我们仍隐蔽着  他们看不见的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.62,0:59:03.58,CHS,636,0,0,0,,克林冈船听着
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.66,0:59:07.46,CHS,637,0,0,0,,我们会制止你们对维星的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.87,0:59:09.71,CHS,638,0,0,0,,立即交还我们总工程师
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.79,0:59:11.96,CHS,639,0,0,0,,然后离开这星系
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.13,0:59:15.63,CHS,640,0,0,0,,无谓浪费时间  消灭他们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.88,0:59:20.05,CHS,641,0,0,0,,对方是银河级星船 我们敌不过它
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.68,0:59:26.31,CHS,642,0,0,0,,那我就给回林先生视力好了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.40,0:59:37.78,CHS,643,0,0,0,,也许他们不在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.86,0:59:41.20,CHS,644,0,0,0,,他们在盘算 21年船龄的克拉冈猛禽
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.32,0:59:43.70,CHS,645,0,0,0,,敌不敌得过联邦旗舰?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.83,0:59:48.58,CHS,646,0,0,0,,- 也许他们已着陆  - 据我计算
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.66,0:59:51.87,CHS,647,0,0,0,,从克林冈船或维星发射探日仪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.00,0:59:53.71,CHS,648,0,0,0,,要11秒才抵达太阳
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.84,0:59:56.92,CHS,649,0,0,0,,但由于没有其原本位置
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.01,1:00:01.51,CHS,650,0,0,0,,我们要八至十五秒时间 才能把武器瞄准探日仪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.59,1:00:04.18,CHS,651,0,0,0,,- 误差幅度大  - 太大
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.43,1:00:06.39,CHS,652,0,0,0,,能量带几时到?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.56,1:00:08.52,CHS,653,0,0,0,,约47分钟后
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.18,1:00:12.48,CHS,654,0,0,0,,我们必须与苏伦联络上
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.56,1:00:15.69,CHS,655,0,0,0,,克林冈船在前面现形
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.44,1:00:22.11,CHS,656,0,0,0,,- 要求对话  - 荧幕显示
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.37,1:00:26.16,CHS,657,0,0,0,,船长  你我真有缘
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.24,1:00:29.54,CHS,658,0,0,0,,我有急事跟苏伦说
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.79,1:00:32.87,CHS,659,0,0,0,,博士已不在敝船
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.46,1:00:38.55,CHS,660,0,0,0,,- 我可以到他处  - 博士不喜欢被骚扰
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.71,1:00:43.13,CHS,661,0,0,0,,你派特遣队去会激怒他
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.22,1:00:46.14,CHS,662,0,0,0,,我上贵船  由你送我去
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.31,1:00:48.14,CHS,663,0,0,0,,不行  他们或已杀了佐迪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.22,1:00:49.52,CHS,664,0,0,0,,他们也会杀你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.60,1:00:54.81,CHS,665,0,0,0,,我们没伤害他  且以礼相待
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.90,1:00:55.98,CHS,666,0,0,0,,那就送他回来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.06,1:01:00.28,CHS,667,0,0,0,,- 用什么交换?  - 用我  船长
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.82,1:01:04.61,CHS,668,0,0,0,,用我  我愿为人质
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.74,1:01:06.37,CHS,669,0,0,0,,但你必须让我见苏伦
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.45,1:01:08.24,CHS,670,0,0,0,,让我可以和他说话
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.33,1:01:13.66,CHS,671,0,0,0,,用皮船长作人质更有价值
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.08,1:01:19.67,CHS,672,0,0,0,,- 那我们就交换人质吧  - 同意
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.09,1:01:25.26,CHS,673,0,0,0,,叫赫医生到传送房3号候命
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.34,1:01:27.01,CHS,674,0,0,0,,大副作指挥
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.48,1:01:35.31,CHS,675,0,0,0,,- 已得悉对方位置  - 传送
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.89,1:02:13.64,CHS,676,0,0,0,,欢迎你  船长
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.57,1:02:28.36,CHS,677,0,0,0,,- 你必当我是狂人  - 我有这样想过
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.16,1:02:30.66,CHS,678,0,0,0,,我知你为何来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.74,1:02:35.08,CHS,679,0,0,0,,你没把握击落我的探日仪
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.16,1:02:41.34,CHS,680,0,0,0,,所以你来游说我放弃计划  祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.59,1:02:46.55,CHS,681,0,0,0,,对不起  船长  我无暇奉陪
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.93,1:02:49.18,CHS,682,0,0,0,,苏伦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.73,1:03:00.35,CHS,683,0,0,0,,当心  那是五百亿瓦力场
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.44,1:03:02.27,CHS,684,0,0,0,,我不想你受伤
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.61,1:03:05.03,CHS,685,0,0,0,,我已联系上去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.20,1:03:09.07,CHS,686,0,0,0,,荧幕显示
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.03,1:03:13.87,CHS,687,0,0,0,,行得通  视器正在传送
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.87,1:03:16.25,CHS,688,0,0,0,,他在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.63,1:03:29.22,CHS,689,0,0,0,,人类女性多么难看
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.39,1:03:33.05,CHS,690,0,0,0,,检查出心肌退化
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.39,1:03:36.72,CHS,691,0,0,0,,我已取出微型疗器 你应无大碍
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.81,1:03:39.14,CHS,692,0,0,0,,我仍需再检查  届时通知你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.23,1:03:40.73,CHS,693,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.48,1:03:47.11,CHS,694,0,0,0,,- 佐迪  - 数据  不要紧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.94,1:03:50.28,CHS,695,0,0,0,,我令你失望  对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.74,1:03:53.91,CHS,696,0,0,0,,近来  我的行为失了常性
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.99,1:03:58.66,CHS,697,0,0,0,,不是失了常性  你的行为添了人性
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.02,1:04:20.35,CHS,698,0,0,0,,你无须出此下策
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.77,1:04:24.61,CHS,699,0,0,0,,必有其他办法令你进入时汇
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.27,1:04:28.69,CHS,700,0,0,0,,我费了80年找寻其他办法
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.69,1:04:32.61,CHS,701,0,0,0,,信我吧  舍此别无他法
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.95,1:04:41.62,CHS,702,0,0,0,,你的图谋
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.71,1:04:44.54,CHS,703,0,0,0,,与当年波格人有何分别?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.79,1:04:47.04,CHS,704,0,0,0,,他们灭绝你族类
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.63,1:04:51.38,CHS,705,0,0,0,,包括你的妻子和儿女
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.68,1:05:00.31,CHS,706,0,0,0,,说得多余
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.02,1:05:09.57,CHS,707,0,0,0,,以前  我连苍蝇也不愿伤害
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.24,1:05:12.07,CHS,708,0,0,0,,跟着  波格人出现
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.41,1:05:18.74,CHS,709,0,0,0,,令我体会到宇宙中的永恒
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.16,1:05:20.54,CHS,710,0,0,0,,唯死亡而已
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.33,1:05:24.62,CHS,711,0,0,0,,后来  我开始淡薄一切
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.71,1:05:28.84,CHS,712,0,0,0,,我们总会死  分别在何时死  如何死
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.42,1:05:31.17,CHS,713,0,0,0,,你也会死
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.01,1:05:35.68,CHS,714,0,0,0,,难道你不觉大限日益接近?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.26,1:05:42.73,CHS,715,0,0,0,,大限像只猎食兽  伺机而噬
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.69,1:05:50.52,CHS,716,0,0,0,,你可借助医药  科技 设法摆脱
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.90,1:05:55.86,CHS,717,0,0,0,,但到头来  难逃大限 人难免一死
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.24,1:06:01.37,CHS,718,0,0,0,,死亡界定做人的意义  构成真理的一部分
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.79,1:06:09.96,CHS,719,0,0,0,,- 我已找到新的真理  - 那时汇?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.09,1:06:15.97,CHS,720,0,0,0,,在那处  时间没意义  猎食兽没杀伤力
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.59,1:06:20.80,CHS,721,0,0,0,,- 佐迪在哪里?  - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.89,1:06:24.06,CHS,722,0,0,0,,他洗澡后  在船中走来走去
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.31,1:06:27.39,CHS,723,0,0,0,,身为工程师
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.48,1:06:29.73,CHS,724,0,0,0,,却不到机房去
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.15,1:06:34.49,CHS,725,0,0,0,,- 如何?  - 我仍找不到船长
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.66,1:06:39.62,CHS,726,0,0,0,,感应器透不过星球的电离层
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.74,1:06:40.82,CHS,727,0,0,0,,干扰太多
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.91,1:06:42.79,CHS,728,0,0,0,,设法探测生物吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.91,1:06:44.66,CHS,729,0,0,0,,乐意之至
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.29,1:06:49.33,CHS,730,0,0,0,,我最喜爱探测生物
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.29,1:06:53.42,CHS,731,0,0,0,,生物
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.09,1:06:57.01,CHS,732,0,0,0,,小小的生物
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.01,1:07:01.18,CHS,733,0,0,0,,珍贵的生物
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.97,1:07:03.97,CHS,734,0,0,0,,你在何方?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.82,1:07:13.02,CHS,735,0,0,0,,终于去到机房
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.32,1:07:18.15,CHS,736,0,0,0,,我想对左舷等离子器 作三级检查
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.28,1:07:19.91,CHS,737,0,0,0,,有个发动机不稳定
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.99,1:07:21.45,CHS,738,0,0,0,,检查吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.71,1:07:37.21,CHS,739,0,0,0,,就在这里  由时标924起重播
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.35,1:07:45.85,CHS,740,0,0,0,,放大这部分
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.23,1:07:55.02,CHS,741,0,0,0,,他们保护罩的调频是257.4
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.15,1:07:58.24,CHS,742,0,0,0,,照样调校我们的光雷弹
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.25,1:08:12.33,CHS,743,0,0,0,,他们懂得渗透保护罩
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.42,1:08:14.04,CHS,744,0,0,0,,瞄准死光炮  还击
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.68,1:08:24.55,CHS,745,0,0,0,,你掌舵  把船开走
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.68,1:08:27.43,CHS,746,0,0,0,,31至35层  船身破裂
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.10,1:08:36.36,CHS,747,0,0,0,,那克林冈旧船
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.44,1:08:39.78,CHS,748,0,0,0,,- 没弱点吗?  - D-12级的猛禽
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.86,1:08:42.65,CHS,749,0,0,0,,等离子圈出毛病  所以退役
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.74,1:08:45.16,CHS,750,0,0,0,,可利用这弱点吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.24,1:08:49.37,CHS,751,0,0,0,,很难  该圈是隐身器的一部分
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.04,1:08:57.75,CHS,752,0,0,0,,稳定那管道
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.80,1:09:01.72,CHS,753,0,0,0,,强化右舷连锁
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.80,1:09:04.09,CHS,754,0,0,0,,必须透过辅助结合把动力改道
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.89,1:09:09.89,CHS,755,0,0,0,,坏等离子圈能抵受离子脉冲吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.97,1:09:13.81,CHS,756,0,0,0,,或许 是个办法
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.90,1:09:16.15,CHS,757,0,0,0,,离子脉冲开启该圈 触动隐身器
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.23,1:09:18.32,CHS,758,0,0,0,,绝妙主意
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.98,1:09:21.28,CHS,759,0,0,0,,这样  保护罩就脱落
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.40,1:09:23.78,CHS,760,0,0,0,,两秒间  他们不设防
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.91,1:09:26.41,CHS,761,0,0,0,,- 瞄准等离子圈  - 行
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.08,1:09:33.75,CHS,762,0,0,0,,- 我们的罩有效  - 全力射击
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.92,1:09:37.75,CHS,763,0,0,0,,准备发射光雷弹
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.84,1:09:39.59,CHS,764,0,0,0,,趁他们隐形前发射
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.67,1:09:41.84,CHS,765,0,0,0,,- 是  船长  - 唯一机会
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.01,1:09:43.59,CHS,766,0,0,0,,射向反应器
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.68,1:09:52.60,CHS,767,0,0,0,,我已取得频率  发放离子脉冲
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.68,1:09:54.27,CHS,768,0,0,0,,尽快
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.61,1:10:05.57,CHS,769,0,0,0,,- 射向驾驶室  - 集中火力
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.66,1:10:07.07,CHS,770,0,0,0,,- 我们隐形  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.16,1:10:08.78,CHS,771,0,0,0,,保护罩脱落
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.37,1:10:14.45,CHS,772,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.99,1:10:48.24,CHS,773,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.20,1:11:34.79,CHS,774,0,0,0,,你真的那么无聊?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.33,1:12:20.54,CHS,775,0,0,0,,必是光雷弹所致
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.62,1:12:21.96,CHS,776,0,0,0,,报告  机房有故障
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.08,1:12:24.58,CHS,777,0,0,0,,磁连锁破裂
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.13,1:12:30.17,CHS,778,0,0,0,,冷却剂泄漏
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.26,1:12:31.34,CHS,779,0,0,0,,大家立即疏散
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.43,1:12:35.26,CHS,780,0,0,0,,大家快走
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.60,1:12:36.76,CHS,781,0,0,0,,- 快  - 疏散
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.85,1:12:38.35,CHS,782,0,0,0,,又有新故障
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.43,1:12:40.18,CHS,783,0,0,0,,五分钟后翘心破裂
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.27,1:12:41.69,CHS,784,0,0,0,,我无能为力了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.15,1:12:46.77,CHS,785,0,0,0,,各人往飞碟区疏散
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.86,1:12:49.53,CHS,786,0,0,0,,数据  准备分离本船
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.03,1:12:56.32,CHS,787,0,0,0,,本船五分钟后分离
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.45,1:13:00.29,CHS,788,0,0,0,,- 我们抬他走  - 所有人都离开  走A通道
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.38,1:13:09.63,CHS,789,0,0,0,,本船4分45秒后分离
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.18,1:13:17.14,CHS,790,0,0,0,,我们把他抬出去  快
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.56,1:13:23.81,CHS,791,0,0,0,,本船4分30秒后分离
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.40,1:13:27.40,CHS,792,0,0,0,,- 别停下来  - 这边走
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.49,1:13:33.65,CHS,793,0,0,0,,本船4分15秒后分离
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.74,1:13:35.03,CHS,794,0,0,0,,- 快  - 别停下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.03,1:13:38.16,CHS,795,0,0,0,,- 花露  - 怎样?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.08,1:13:41.91,CHS,796,0,0,0,,孩子们没人照顾  送去W室吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.00,1:13:44.25,CHS,797,0,0,0,,- 快点 小甜心 - 我们会找到他们的父母的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.42,1:13:48.00,CHS,798,0,0,0,,本船四分钟后分离
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.07,1:14:20.62,CHS,799,0,0,0,,船长  恕我失陪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.70,1:14:25.87,CHS,800,0,0,0,,我与永恒有约会  不想迟到
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.97,1:14:46.10,CHS,801,0,0,0,,翘心即将破裂  我们非走不可
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.98,1:14:50.98,CHS,802,0,0,0,,- 报告  疏散完毕  - 一分钟后翘心破裂
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.07,1:14:54.32,CHS,803,0,0,0,,分离一完毕  全速冲走
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.40,1:14:55.78,CHS,804,0,0,0,,翘心到达临界状态
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.92,1:15:13.96,CHS,805,0,0,0,,- 分离完毕  - 发动冲力引擎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.42,1:15:16.42,CHS,806,0,0,0,,翘心开始破裂
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.43,1:15:27.52,CHS,807,0,0,0,,稳定器失灵  发动辅助系统
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.19,1:15:35.61,CHS,808,0,0,0,,- 报告上来  - 导航电控失灵
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.28,1:15:44.33,CHS,809,0,0,0,,惨
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.25,1:16:34.33,CHS,810,0,0,0,,这边走
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.17,1:16:38.17,CHS,811,0,0,0,,来帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.55,1:16:40.88,CHS,812,0,0,0,,快走别停下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.01,1:16:43.34,CHS,813,0,0,0,,- 卧倒  - 快躲上床
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.39,1:16:52.77,CHS,814,0,0,0,,副动力已改用来横向推进
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.85,1:16:55.02,CHS,815,0,0,0,,希望减低下降速度
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.36,1:16:57.27,CHS,816,0,0,0,,各人准备撞击
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.36,1:17:04.86,CHS,817,0,0,0,,- 大家抓紧  - 抱着头部
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.52,1:18:57.06,CHS,818,0,0,0,,我没受伤
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.19,1:22:32.69,CHS,819,0,0,0,,怎么回事  我在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.88,1:22:52.88,CHS,820,0,0,0,,- 惊奇吧  - 我们爱你  爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.05,1:22:55.38,CHS,821,0,0,0,,- 吓着你吗?  - 看圣诞树
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.47,1:22:58.47,CHS,822,0,0,0,,- 我帮忙布置  - 花了一整天
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.55,1:23:01.01,CHS,823,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐  爸爸  - 看这些礼物
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.10,1:23:03.47,CHS,824,0,0,0,,- 我爱你  爸爸  - 我也爱你们
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.72,1:23:07.89,CHS,825,0,0,0,,孩子们  别缠着爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.99,1:23:24.41,CHS,826,0,0,0,,- 喝杯茶吗?  - 最好不过
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.30,1:23:37.13,CHS,827,0,0,0,,- 这是送给你的  - 谢谢你  连尼
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.18,1:23:40.84,CHS,828,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐  伯父  - 圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.93,1:23:43.35,CHS,829,0,0,0,,帮我铺餐桌好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.18,1:23:46.60,CHS,830,0,0,0,,连尼
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.94,1:23:50.19,CHS,831,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.12,1:24:08.79,CHS,832,0,0,0,,帮你的伯娘去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.85,1:24:25.56,CHS,833,0,0,0,,不对劲
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.43,1:25:52.23,CHS,834,0,0,0,,这不是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.77,1:25:57.81,CHS,835,0,0,0,,- 这不是真的  - 你要怎样真实都可以
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.90,1:26:02.82,CHS,836,0,0,0,,姬兰  怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.07,1:26:07.57,CHS,837,0,0,0,,- 我在哪里?  - 在时汇里
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.08,1:26:14.41,CHS,838,0,0,0,,- 这就是时汇?  - 对你而言  这是你所期求的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.62,1:26:20.63,CHS,839,0,0,0,,但我从没有过这样的家庭
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.42,1:26:28.43,CHS,840,0,0,0,,也没有妻儿  但他们都是我的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.31,1:26:34.68,CHS,841,0,0,0,,姬兰  你在这里干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.44,1:26:37.40,CHS,842,0,0,0,,你不在企业号上吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.48,1:26:40.27,CHS,843,0,0,0,,我在企业号  也在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.36,1:26:45.44,CHS,844,0,0,0,,把我当作姬兰的回音
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.03,1:26:48.66,CHS,845,0,0,0,,留在时汇的一部分
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.78,1:26:51.78,CHS,846,0,0,0,,企业B号把你从濑鸥救走时
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.87,1:26:57.00,CHS,847,0,0,0,,- 爸  帮我筑城堡  - 可以  等一会
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.83,1:27:04.71,CHS,848,0,0,0,,爸爸  谢谢你的洋娃娃  好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.30,1:27:13.56,CHS,849,0,0,0,,他们都是我的儿女  他们都是我的儿女
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.85,1:27:17.23,CHS,850,0,0,0,,当然  时间在这里已没意义
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.02,1:27:20.15,CHS,851,0,0,0,,你可倒流时光  看他们出生
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.23,1:27:23.86,CHS,852,0,0,0,,或去到未来  探望你的孙儿
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.53,1:27:27.03,CHS,853,0,0,0,,大家吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.15,1:27:28.36,CHS,854,0,0,0,,- 好啊 - 好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.82,1:27:31.37,CHS,855,0,0,0,,妈妈  我能不能
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.70,1:27:35.33,CHS,856,0,0,0,,- 吃晚餐了  爸爸   - 好  过来
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.41,1:27:37.04,CHS,857,0,0,0,,这是你最喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.90,1:28:08.40,CHS,858,0,0,0,,你去吃  不必等我
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.38,1:28:33.09,CHS,859,0,0,0,,姬兰  我可离开时汇吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.43,1:28:36.72,CHS,860,0,0,0,,- 你想去哪里?  - 我不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.06,1:28:39.60,CHS,861,0,0,0,,如我所说  时间在此没意义
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.73,1:28:43.56,CHS,862,0,0,0,,你可随时随地离去
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.15,1:28:46.11,CHS,863,0,0,0,,我想回到
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.23,1:28:50.11,CHS,864,0,0,0,,维星3号的山顶
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.24,1:28:53.91,CHS,865,0,0,0,,趁苏伦未摧毁星球  制止他
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.24,1:28:55.99,CHS,866,0,0,0,,我想你帮我  跟我回去
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.08,1:28:59.83,CHS,867,0,0,0,,我既仍在那里  又怎能回去?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.91,1:29:03.58,CHS,868,0,0,0,,但我知有人能回去
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.58,1:29:08.25,CHS,869,0,0,0,,而在他看来  他也是初抵时汇
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.31,1:29:18.64,CHS,870,0,0,0,,却克
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.60,1:29:22.69,CHS,871,0,0,0,,占士却克
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.94,1:29:29.48,CHS,872,0,0,0,,天气好
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.95,1:29:34.78,CHS,873,0,0,0,,的确好
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.62,1:29:44.17,CHS,874,0,0,0,,介意吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.80,1:29:59.14,CHS,875,0,0,0,,船长  不知你有没有察觉到
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.22,1:30:02.35,CHS,876,0,0,0,,等一等  你闻到烧焦味吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.15,1:30:18.41,CHS,877,0,0,0,,似乎有人在煎蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.99,1:30:22.87,CHS,878,0,0,0,,进来  别客气  这是舍下
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.88,1:30:28.33,CHS,879,0,0,0,,是以前的舍下
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.25,1:30:31.84,CHS,880,0,0,0,,多年前已出售
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.88,1:30:39.18,CHS,881,0,0,0,,我是皮尚鲁船长  主管企业号
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.68,1:30:44.06,CHS,882,0,0,0,,这时钟
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.52,1:30:50.52,CHS,883,0,0,0,,我已送给阿骨
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.86,1:30:56.28,CHS,884,0,0,0,,你可说  我是来自将来的24世纪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.45,1:31:01.74,CHS,885,0,0,0,,管家
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.58,1:31:07.75,CHS,886,0,0,0,,管家
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.04,1:31:11.54,CHS,887,0,0,0,,你怎会在这里?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.26,1:31:15.09,CHS,888,0,0,0,,管家已去世七年
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.38,1:31:17.88,CHS,889,0,0,0,,占  我很饿
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.97,1:31:21.55,CHS,890,0,0,0,,你几时才烧好菜
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.81,1:31:23.22,CHS,891,0,0,0,,安妮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.89,1:31:30.98,CHS,892,0,0,0,,你说什么? 将来?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.73,1:31:34.40,CHS,893,0,0,0,,这是过去
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.57,1:31:38.57,CHS,894,0,0,0,,是9年前
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.25,1:31:58.26,CHS,895,0,0,0,,当日  我告诉她我会重返星舰
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.85,1:32:12.35,CHS,896,0,0,0,,这些是她爱吃的卡它蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.44,1:32:14.98,CHS,897,0,0,0,,没告诉她前  烧给她吃
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.94,1:32:20.82,CHS,898,0,0,0,,你所见的事物  似是真却非真
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.95,1:32:23.99,CHS,899,0,0,0,,这并非是你真正的房子
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.12,1:32:27.79,CHS,900,0,0,0,,你我被困在某时光交汇内
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.71,1:32:32.46,CHS,901,0,0,0,,- 对不起  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.54,1:32:35.63,CHS,902,0,0,0,,小茴香  柜内左手边第二格
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.55,1:32:39.30,CHS,903,0,0,0,,牛至叶粉背后
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.22,1:32:50.02,CHS,904,0,0,0,,- 你来了多久?  - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.19,1:32:56.11,CHS,905,0,0,0,,我当时在企业B号导向器控制室内
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.19,1:32:57.98,CHS,906,0,0,0,,拜托你搅一搅
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.49,1:32:59.99,CHS,907,0,0,0,,前面的舱壁消失
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.07,1:33:02.86,CHS,908,0,0,0,,然后在你出现前  我在斩柴
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.99,1:33:05.16,CHS,909,0,0,0,,在你走之前
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.16,1:33:07.49,CHS,910,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.83,1:33:12.37,CHS,911,0,0,0,,据历史  你在80年前殉职
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.87,1:33:18.21,CHS,912,0,0,0,,为救企业B号  摆脱某能量带
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.22,1:33:22.59,CHS,913,0,0,0,,你说这是24世纪?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.72,1:33:27.55,CHS,914,0,0,0,,- 我已死去?  - 算不上
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.68,1:33:31.18,CHS,915,0,0,0,,- 如我所说  是某种时光交汇  - 时光交汇  对  我听过
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.89,1:33:35.06,CHS,916,0,0,0,,- 我  - 缺少一样东西
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.90,1:33:45.41,CHS,917,0,0,0,,船长  我需要你帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.24,1:33:50.16,CHS,918,0,0,0,,与我同离时汇
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.25,1:33:53.08,CHS,919,0,0,0,,前往维星3号 苏伦意图毁灭星球
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.12,1:33:56.42,CHS,920,0,0,0,,百万生灵  危在旦夕
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.46,1:34:01.59,CHS,921,0,0,0,,历史既判定我已死  我怎反对
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.72,1:34:04.13,CHS,922,0,0,0,,你是船长  职责所在
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.22,1:34:06.01,CHS,923,0,0,0,,别来教训  我拯救星系时
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.09,1:34:09.97,CHS,924,0,0,0,,令祖仍包着尿布
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.39,1:34:12.81,CHS,925,0,0,0,,况且  星系欠我个人情
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.23,1:34:18.44,CHS,926,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.78,1:34:24.32,CHS,927,0,0,0,,我以前像你
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.40,1:34:28.78,CHS,928,0,0,0,,满脑袋责任  义务  公尔忘私  鞠躬尽瘁
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.24,1:34:35.75,CHS,929,0,0,0,,结果我得到什么? 空屋一间
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.51,1:34:44.01,CHS,930,0,0,0,,这次不同
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.80,1:34:50.26,CHS,931,0,0,0,,这次我会走上楼梯  朝那睡房
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.35,1:34:53.56,CHS,932,0,0,0,,大步闯入  向安妮求婚
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.64,1:34:56.44,CHS,933,0,0,0,,这次  情形会不同
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.01,1:35:29.51,CHS,934,0,0,0,,- 这不是你的房子  - 不是  比我的更好
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.89,1:35:34.56,CHS,935,0,0,0,,- 更好?  - 是我叔父在爱达荷的农谷
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.64,1:35:39.98,CHS,936,0,0,0,,11年前春天某日 我骑着这匹马
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.98,1:35:50.41,CHS,937,0,0,0,,就像今天  也在同一天我认识了安妮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.16,1:35:53.74,CHS,938,0,0,0,,你那时汇很聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.20,1:35:58.16,CHS,939,0,0,0,,所有一切我都可重新做起
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.43,1:37:39.10,CHS,940,0,0,0,,我跳过那条坑50次  每次都怕得要命
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.93,1:37:41.60,CHS,941,0,0,0,,除了这次
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.44,1:37:45.31,CHS,942,0,0,0,,因为不是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.78,1:37:51.11,CHS,943,0,0,0,,安妮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.20,1:37:53.99,CHS,944,0,0,0,,她也不是真的?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.61,1:37:58.45,CHS,945,0,0,0,,这里一切都不是真的  都是无关痛痒
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.29,1:38:03.12,CHS,946,0,0,0,,也许问题不在空房子
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.21,1:38:07.13,CHS,947,0,0,0,,而在企业号驾驶室的空椅子
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.46,1:38:13.47,CHS,948,0,0,0,,自从我退休后  我无所作为
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.64,1:38:27.35,CHS,949,0,0,0,,- 你是企业号船长?  - 正是
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.36,1:38:30.32,CHS,950,0,0,0,,行将退休?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.65,1:38:33.69,CHS,951,0,0,0,,- 还没考虑过  - 奉劝你: 别考虑
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.65,1:38:37.20,CHS,952,0,0,0,,不要升职  不要调职
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.32,1:38:41.08,CHS,953,0,0,0,,不要做任何令你丢职的事
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.16,1:38:44.87,CHS,954,0,0,0,,只要是船长  你仍有所作为
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.21,1:38:49.63,CHS,955,0,0,0,,跟我回去  帮我阻止苏伦
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.71,1:38:51.84,CHS,956,0,0,0,,再有所作为
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.43,1:39:07.31,CHS,957,0,0,0,,对企业号船长  我怎敢反抗?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.40,1:39:08.44,CHS,958,0,0,0,,那星球的名字叫什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.52,1:39:10.69,CHS,959,0,0,0,,- 那星球叫维星3号?  - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.77,1:39:13.98,CHS,960,0,0,0,,形势险恶  不利我们?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.07,1:39:15.74,CHS,961,0,0,0,,可以这样说
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.70,1:39:18.78,CHS,962,0,0,0,,冼朴在此  会认为我
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.87,1:39:23.20,CHS,963,0,0,0,,接受这任务
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.29,1:39:25.70,CHS,964,0,0,0,,不合理性  逻辑
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.37,1:39:30.04,CHS,965,0,0,0,,似乎挺过瘾
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.39,1:39:48.02,CHS,966,0,0,0,,辅助动力已改用来横向推进
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.10,1:39:50.23,CHS,967,0,0,0,,希望减低下降速度
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.44,1:39:52.56,CHS,968,0,0,0,,各人准备撞击
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.82,1:40:39.86,CHS,969,0,0,0,,- 你是何方神圣?  - 占士却克
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.28,1:40:43.28,CHS,970,0,0,0,,你没读过历史?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.54,1:40:50.79,CHS,971,0,0,0,,我去发射台
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.79,1:40:55.67,CHS,972,0,0,0,,- 能量带一分钟内到  - 我去对付苏伦
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.67,1:41:35.33,CHS,973,0,0,0,,事实上  我熟读历史
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.42,1:41:38.55,CHS,974,0,0,0,,据我所知  你已归西
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.01,1:42:23.30,CHS,975,0,0,0,,你没去发射台?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.38,1:42:26.38,CHS,976,0,0,0,,船长有权改变初衷
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.66,1:42:52.66,CHS,977,0,0,0,,我们需要遥控器
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.09,1:43:00.63,CHS,978,0,0,0,,船长  看
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.30,1:43:04.84,CHS,979,0,0,0,,苏伦呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.49,1:44:11.49,CHS,980,0,0,0,,我们时间无多
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.57,1:44:15.24,CHS,981,0,0,0,,看  那遥控器仍在另一边
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.33,1:44:17.12,CHS,982,0,0,0,,我去取来  你去发射台
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.20,1:44:20.00,CHS,983,0,0,0,,不  我们并肩作战
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.08,1:44:23.17,CHS,984,0,0,0,,我们是并肩作战  去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.25,1:44:25.67,CHS,985,0,0,0,,- 祝好运  船长  - 叫我做占士
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.68,1:46:02.10,CHS,986,0,0,0,,皮尚鲁
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.85,1:46:06.02,CHS,987,0,0,0,,离开发射台
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.82,1:46:11.19,CHS,988,0,0,0,,立即
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.83,1:47:53.55,CHS,989,0,0,0,,成功了吗?  我们有所作为吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.05,1:47:59.30,CHS,990,0,0,0,,对  我们有所作为  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.52,1:48:10.40,CHS,991,0,0,0,,我起码可以为企业号船长效劳
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.61,1:48:23.16,CHS,992,0,0,0,,过瘾
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.63,1:48:36.00,CHS,993,0,0,0,,的确
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.30,1:50:02.97,CHS,994,0,0,0,,船长日志  星历48650.1
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.05,1:50:05.51,CHS,995,0,0,0,,三艘星船已抵达
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.59,1:50:08.30,CHS,996,0,0,0,,把企业号的生还者救起
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.39,1:50:09.85,CHS,997,0,0,0,,我方死伤者少
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.93,1:50:14.19,CHS,998,0,0,0,,可惜是企业号本身无可挽救
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.69,1:50:17.23,CHS,999,0,0,0,,我一直都穷于应付情绪
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.31,1:50:21.19,CHS,1000,0,0,0,,你为什么不切除情绪晶片?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.28,1:50:25.95,CHS,1001,0,0,0,,起初  我不适应情绪的难测
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.70,1:50:31.45,CHS,1002,0,0,0,,但经历261种不同的变化后
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.91,1:50:34.79,CHS,1003,0,0,0,,情绪开始受我控制
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.87,1:50:37.25,CHS,1004,0,0,0,,而不是被情绪所控
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.58,1:50:39.75,CHS,1005,0,0,0,,我希望你成功
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.88,1:50:44.01,CHS,1006,0,0,0,,这里有个东西
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.76,1:50:47.76,CHS,1007,0,0,0,,微弱的生命迹象
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.69,1:51:03.11,CHS,1008,0,0,0,,小斑
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.90,1:51:09.32,CHS,1009,0,0,0,,真高兴见到你  小斑
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.91,1:51:13.91,CHS,1010,0,0,0,,另一次天伦团聚
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.96,1:51:20.67,CHS,1011,0,0,0,,数据  你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.13,1:51:25.80,CHS,1012,0,0,0,,很难说  顾问
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.88,1:51:30.47,CHS,1013,0,0,0,,我高兴见到小斑  但我却哭泣
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.43,1:51:35.98,CHS,1014,0,0,0,,或许晶片出毛病
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.73,1:51:40.06,CHS,1015,0,0,0,,晶片的性能绝佳
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.95,1:51:49.03,CHS,1016,0,0,0,,你好  小斑
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.62,1:51:57.04,CHS,1017,0,0,0,,是这个?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.83,1:52:03.04,CHS,1018,0,0,0,,对  大副  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.39,1:52:13.43,CHS,1019,0,0,0,,我会怀念这船  她的大限太早到
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.77,1:52:22.65,CHS,1020,0,0,0,,有人曾告诉我  大限像只猎食兽  伺机而噬
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.73,1:52:25.57,CHS,1021,0,0,0,,但我认为大限是
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.65,1:52:27.86,CHS,1022,0,0,0,,我们人生的良伴
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.95,1:52:34.03,CHS,1023,0,0,0,,提醒我们珍惜光阴  因为光阴一去不返
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.33,1:52:41.12,CHS,1024,0,0,0,,与其建功立业 不如活得有意义
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.79,1:52:45.63,CHS,1025,0,0,0,,毕竟我们难免一死
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.05,1:52:50.30,CHS,1026,0,0,0,,你自说自话  我想永远活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.51,1:52:58.98,CHS,1027,0,0,0,,我一直希望升任船长
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.60,1:53:02.60,CHS,1028,0,0,0,,也许有机会
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.94,1:53:05.98,CHS,1029,0,0,0,,这大概不会是
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.07,1:53:08.32,CHS,1030,0,0,0,,最后一艘企业号
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.54,1:53:19.79,CHS,1031,0,0,0,,法拉格号
